(2974208, 418341, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is superb. Makes me think of an old Charlie Chaplin movie.  Great shot!!! Love the contrast and DOF.</td>', 'This is superb. Makes me think of an old Charlie Chaplin movie.  Great shot!!! Love the contrast and DOF.', '2006-10-30 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
