(2974293, 419141, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really like this. I might do a touch of dodge on her face, but other than that - really a nice image.</td>', 'Very cool. I really like this. I might do a touch of dodge on her face, but other than that - really a nice image.', '2006-10-30 00:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
