(2974338, 419178, 22537, '<td valign="top">Exceptional submission.  This is really similar, if not, a Dr. Jones trademark. Overall, very strong and technically tight. Good luck! 8</td>', 'Exceptional submission.  This is really similar, if not, a Dr. Jones trademark. Overall, very strong and technically tight. Good luck! 8', '2006-10-30 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
