(2974346, 417172, 22537, '<td valign="top">Lots of flags this challenge! I like how this flag is the complete image as I really do not care about the flag pole in the others. Colors are vibrant and sharp. Good luck!</td>', 'Lots of flags this challenge! I like how this flag is the complete image as I really do not care about the flag pole in the others. Colors are vibrant and sharp. Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974354, 418341, 22537, '<td valign="top">Firstly, I really dig your frame as it adds to this theatrical submission. Since you went to the effort anyhow, a leaf blower may have kicked up some of the leaves on the ground that betrayed your subject.  No need to worry as the betrayal was weak and you walk away with a 7 from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Firstly, I really dig your frame as it adds to this theatrical submission. Since you went to the effort anyhow, a leaf blower may have kicked up some of the leaves on the ground that betrayed your subject.  No need to worry as the betrayal was weak and you walk away with a 7 from me.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974371, 419181, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent placement within the composition.  The hue is soft but I''m picking up a fair amount of noise and haloing on the rudder. Other than that, I think it is a great effort and worthy of a 7.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent placement within the composition.  The hue is soft but I''m picking up a fair amount of noise and haloing on the rudder. Other than that, I think it is a great effort and worthy of a 7.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974376, 418689, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is really cool and bleak.  I like bleak and moody shots.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is really cool and bleak.  I like bleak and moody shots.  Nice work!', '2006-10-30 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974390, 418630, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  The colors are vibrant and the expression is sincere and engaging of the challenge theme. I would have preferred to drop her a little lower into the frame if that was at all an option. It would have made her appear to have been standing and captured more of her hair.  Other than that, top 10 for sure.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent composition.  The colors are vibrant and the expression is sincere and engaging of the challenge theme. I would have preferred to drop her a little lower into the frame if that was at all an option. It would have made her appear to have been standing and captured more of her hair.  Other than that, top 10 for sure.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974392, 418521, 22537, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot and composition.  The gold appears slightly oversaturated but at little expense to the shot.  Great work and good luck! 7</td>', 'Fabulous shot and composition.  The gold appears slightly oversaturated but at little expense to the shot.  Great work and good luck! 7', '2006-10-30 00:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974394, 419107, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Could you ask for a better subject related to this challenge? All of the elements work and I''d be disappointed if this does not ribbon. Bumping to an 8!  Good luck.</td>', 'This is awesome!  Could you ask for a better subject related to this challenge? All of the elements work and I''d be disappointed if this does not ribbon. Bumping to an 8!  Good luck.', '2006-10-30 00:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974410, 418842, 22537, '<td valign="top">Though I do not do portraits myself, I have great appreciation when they are done well and this is the case here.  I would challenge anyone to dismiss this from being a ribbon contender. I''d say this is one of only a handful of images I''ve every given a 9 and it deserves it. I hope you enjoy the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Though I do not do portraits myself, I have great appreciation when they are done well and this is the case here.  I would challenge anyone to dismiss this from being a ribbon contender. I''d say this is one of only a handful of images I''ve every given a 9 and it deserves it. I hope you enjoy the blue ribbon!', '2006-10-30 00:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974419, 419194, 22537, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nicely executed.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974420, 418162, 22537, '<td valign="top">Lotsa flag pictures but the orientation of this shot deserves a recognition.  Good luck!</td>', 'Lotsa flag pictures but the orientation of this shot deserves a recognition.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974423, 417415, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and natural.  Nice work and good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful and natural.  Nice work and good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974426, 419395, 22537, '<td valign="top">Windmills are very cool.  I like the toning and the lay of the land.  Good work and good luck!</td>', 'Windmills are very cool.  I like the toning and the lay of the land.  Good work and good luck!', '2006-10-30 00:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2974432, 417768, 45000, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing.  Quite possibly one of the most gorgeous pictures I''ve ever seen grace the pages of DPC.<br/> <br/>Just perfect.  The only thing I could suggest to do different would be to clone out the stars in the background, I think it would look better without them....just a little thing though.<br/> <br/>Congradulations.....it''s already a ribbon winner in my eyes.</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing.  Quite possibly one of the most gorgeous pictures I''ve ever seen grace the pages of DPC. Just perfect.  The only thing I could suggest to do different would be to clone out the stars in the background, I think it would look better without them....just a little thing though. Congradulations.....it''s already a ribbon winner in my eyes.', '2006-10-30 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
