(2975326, 419295, 64175, '<td valign="top">This image has nice colors and the composition is okay.  But, I as a viewer take away that this is much more a blurred image rather than a "Wind" image.  If the composition had showh the leaf floating through the air with a static background, it would better display the wind effect IMO.  5.</td>', 'This image has nice colors and the composition is okay.  But, I as a viewer take away that this is much more a blurred image rather than a "Wind" image.  If the composition had showh the leaf floating through the air with a static background, it would better display the wind effect IMO.  5.', '2006-10-30 10:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975328, 418914, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective color and the wispy ends of the branches are good at carrying the challenge message to the viewer (Windy).<br/> <br/>Good job.  10.</td>', 'Nice use of selective color and the wispy ends of the branches are good at carrying the challenge message to the viewer (Windy). Good job.  10.', '2006-10-30 10:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975332, 419367, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great composition with the sailboats in the river/harbor.  The only critique I really have is that the background of the cityscape is so busy that the sailboats almost get lost amongst the buildings. Very nice clarity in the shot.  Score: 9</td>', 'Great composition with the sailboats in the river/harbor.  The only critique I really have is that the background of the cityscape is so busy that the sailboats almost get lost amongst the buildings. Very nice clarity in the shot.  Score: 9', '2006-10-30 10:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975341, 419293, 64175, '<td valign="top">There have  been a number of blurred shots in the challenge.  Unfortunately, to me as a viewer, it is hard to tell if the blur is formed from the wind moving the subject during the open shutter or if it is simply motion blur due to a hand-held photo.  So, I get more of "Blurred" instead of "Wind" as the perception.  The small piece of fence in the background helps to identify that it was a moving subject rather than moving photographer but I have to go searching for that stable point of reference.<br/> <br/>I really like the choice of colors you found for the composition as they do improve its visual appeal.  <br/> <br/>Score: 8.</td>', 'There have  been a number of blurred shots in the challenge.  Unfortunately, to me as a viewer, it is hard to tell if the blur is formed from the wind moving the subject during the open shutter or if it is simply motion blur due to a hand-held photo.  So, I get more of "Blurred" instead of "Wind" as the perception.  The small piece of fence in the background helps to identify that it was a moving subject rather than moving photographer but I have to go searching for that stable point of reference. I really like the choice of colors you found for the composition as they do improve its visual appeal.   Score: 8.', '2006-10-30 10:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975342, 417381, 64175, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here.  The colors of the yellows,greens, and oranges.  Unfortunately, I don''t get teh feeling of "Windy" from this image.  I get, seclusion, wandering, or simply, "deep woods".  The composition is enough to get a few bonus points over difficulty conveying the challenge criteria (from my perception of course).<br/> <br/>Score: 8.</td>', 'I really like the composition here.  The colors of the yellows,greens, and oranges.  Unfortunately, I don''t get teh feeling of "Windy" from this image.  I get, seclusion, wandering, or simply, "deep woods".  The composition is enough to get a few bonus points over difficulty conveying the challenge criteria (from my perception of course). Score: 8.', '2006-10-30 10:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975347, 418341, 3746, '<td valign="top">saw  this image whilst browsing the thumbnails.. very very good, although the stationary dry leaves on the ground detract from the overall effect... very nice shot though.</td>', 'saw  this image whilst browsing the thumbnails.. very very good, although the stationary dry leaves on the ground detract from the overall effect... very nice shot though.', '2006-10-30 10:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975350, 419050, 64175, '<td valign="top">There have been a number of images (IMO) in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer. This image falls into that category for me.<br/> <br/>I like the colors you have captured in the oranges, yellows, greens, and they almost form an abstract image.  I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving.<br/> <br/>Score: 5.</td>', 'There have been a number of images (IMO) in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer. This image falls into that category for me. I like the colors you have captured in the oranges, yellows, greens, and they almost form an abstract image.  I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving. Score: 5.', '2006-10-30 10:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975353, 419124, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the subject and scarf to convey the challenge criterai. The image is a little overexposed (too bright or washed out) on the front of the model.<br/> <br/>Score: 6.</td>', 'Nice use of the subject and scarf to convey the challenge criterai. The image is a little overexposed (too bright or washed out) on the front of the model. Score: 6.', '2006-10-30 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975354, 418286, 64175, '<td valign="top">There have been a number of images (IMO) in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer. This image falls into that category for me.<br/> <br/>I like the colors you have captured in the reds, oranges, yellows, greens, and they almost form an abstract image.  I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving.<br/> <br/>Your composition is the best I have seen among the blurred images. I''ve been giving those about a 5-6.  This one is so nice in composition, that I''m going with an 8.</td>', 'There have been a number of images (IMO) in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer. This image falls into that category for me. I like the colors you have captured in the reds, oranges, yellows, greens, and they almost form an abstract image.  I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving. Your composition is the best I have seen among the blurred images. I''ve been giving those about a 5-6.  This one is so nice in composition, that I''m going with an 8.', '2006-10-30 10:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975355, 417041, 36619, '<td valign="top">way cool editing, love this shot!</td>', 'way cool editing, love this shot!', '2006-10-30 10:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975356, 418774, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I was thinking kites too when I first saw the challenge.  It looks like the image may have been a little over sharpened in post processing as the edges around the black are a little pixelated.<br/> <br/>Score: 6.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I was thinking kites too when I first saw the challenge.  It looks like the image may have been a little over sharpened in post processing as the edges around the black are a little pixelated. Score: 6.', '2006-10-30 10:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975357, 418521, 75713, '<td valign="top">The composition is strong, the colors are great and this shot is beautifully photographed.  What really made me give it a 10 is the feeling I get when I look at it.. I think of the times I was out when it was blowing a gale and the waves were crashing and the excitement and aliveness I feel - that''s what great photos should do.. make us feel/think - thank you</td>', 'The composition is strong, the colors are great and this shot is beautifully photographed.  What really made me give it a 10 is the feeling I get when I look at it.. I think of the times I was out when it was blowing a gale and the waves were crashing and the excitement and aliveness I feel - that''s what great photos should do.. make us feel/think - thank you', '2006-10-30 10:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975358, 419113, 64175, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, the simple things are best.  Good job.  9.</td>', 'Sometimes, the simple things are best.  Good job.  9.', '2006-10-30 10:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975364, 418623, 64175, '<td valign="top">I''m starting to recognize some of the popular backgrounds.  Very nice colors and rainbow effect fo the sunset.  The matching effect on the scarf is a nice touch and of course is a good way to convey the Wind theme.  10.</td>', 'I''m starting to recognize some of the popular backgrounds.  Very nice colors and rainbow effect fo the sunset.  The matching effect on the scarf is a nice touch and of course is a good way to convey the Wind theme.  10.', '2006-10-30 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
