(2975367, 418417, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh in this one.  One of the first with blurred outlines that enhance the image and show it as wind rather than camera (photographer) blur.<br/> <br/>Score: 9.</td>', 'Nice bokeh in this one.  One of the first with blurred outlines that enhance the image and show it as wind rather than camera (photographer) blur. Score: 9.', '2006-10-30 10:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975371, 419254, 64175, '<td valign="top">The edges of the circles in the bokeh are a little edgy, but the overall photograph is excellent.  nice use of the model with just a gentle breeze.<br/> <br/>Score: 10.</td>', 'The edges of the circles in the bokeh are a little edgy, but the overall photograph is excellent.  nice use of the model with just a gentle breeze. Score: 10.', '2006-10-30 10:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975374, 418966, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love this photo... the way the huge tree is towering over the building... the strong sense of motion ( I can hear the branches whipping the garage) - the left part of the tree is the first place the eye is drawn but then the bend of the tree/branches brings the eye down to the shed... great choice of b&amp;w - I love the post processing - great feel to this shot - 9</td>', 'I love this photo... the way the huge tree is towering over the building... the strong sense of motion ( I can hear the branches whipping the garage) - the left part of the tree is the first place the eye is drawn but then the bend of the tree/branches brings the eye down to the shed... great choice of b&w - I love the post processing - great feel to this shot - 9', '2006-10-30 10:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975378, 419197, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice composition choice.  Very nice colors.  the image though does not really make me think of wind.  It just appears as a very nice shot of the flower.  The wind may in fact be blowing but there is not enough sway to the subject to convey that IMO.<br/> <br/>Score: 6.</td>', 'Nice composition choice.  Very nice colors.  the image though does not really make me think of wind.  It just appears as a very nice shot of the flower.  The wind may in fact be blowing but there is not enough sway to the subject to convey that IMO. Score: 6.', '2006-10-30 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975379, 418309, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo of the fall leaves being blown.  The corner of the white picket fence distracts a little bit from this but I''m not sure you could have really cropped it out with out taking away from the image due to a shortened road.<br/> <br/>Score: 9</td>', 'Very nice photo of the fall leaves being blown.  The corner of the white picket fence distracts a little bit from this but I''m not sure you could have really cropped it out with out taking away from the image due to a shortened road. Score: 9', '2006-10-30 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975380, 418472, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. In this composition though, I think you could have gotten away with a faster shutter and captured the image without any blur.  The flag going horizontal would have already conveyed the message of wind, so in this case, the blur of the flag ends actually takes away from the image just a bit.<br/> <br/>Still a very nice shot.  Score: 8.</td>', 'Very nice shot. In this composition though, I think you could have gotten away with a faster shutter and captured the image without any blur.  The flag going horizontal would have already conveyed the message of wind, so in this case, the blur of the flag ends actually takes away from the image just a bit. Still a very nice shot.  Score: 8.', '2006-10-30 10:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975381, 419141, 75713, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and good job lighting the models face - I feel a sense of wind in this shot... not a strong wind as her hair is not being whipped about but a more gentle wind that suits the composition of this photo. 9</td>', 'lovely colors and good job lighting the models face - I feel a sense of wind in this shot... not a strong wind as her hair is not being whipped about but a more gentle wind that suits the composition of this photo. 9', '2006-10-30 10:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975383, 418842, 55956, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-10-30 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
