(2975402, 416199, 64175, '<td valign="top">There have been a number of images in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer (solely my opinion of course). This image falls into that category for me.<br/> <br/>I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving.<br/> <br/>The diagonal plane in the bottom right corner is distracting to me as I don''t know if it is supposed to be a vertical or horizontal subject from which to reference the rest of the composition.<br/> <br/>Score: 5.</td>', 'There have been a number of images in this challenge where the subject comes off as blurred rather than as portraying Wind to the viewer (solely my opinion of course). This image falls into that category for me. I just wish there was something that showed me more wind rather than blurred/moving image which can happen due to camera shake or if the photographer is moving rather than the subject moving. The diagonal plane in the bottom right corner is distracting to me as I don''t know if it is supposed to be a vertical or horizontal subject from which to reference the rest of the composition. Score: 5.', '2006-10-30 10:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
