(2975458, 419319, 55956, '<td valign="top">it can be a good image, unfortunately is oblique and I think that the building is too much on the top. 5</td>', 'it can be a good image, unfortunately is oblique and I think that the building is too much on the top. 5', '2006-10-30 10:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975472, 419299, 22537, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very strong image and the blowing sand is reminiscent of drifting snow. My only grief is the harsh burning within the clouds as it seems too bright to cast such harsh shadows.  Had that been a  bit more subtle, I would have surely expected to see this in the top ten.  Good luck!</td>', 'I think this is a very strong image and the blowing sand is reminiscent of drifting snow. My only grief is the harsh burning within the clouds as it seems too bright to cast such harsh shadows.  Had that been a  bit more subtle, I would have surely expected to see this in the top ten.  Good luck!', '2006-10-30 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975475, 419171, 67152, '<td valign="top">Talk about simple yet on the mark.  I really like the use of light on the shear.  The cropping to must include the whole door perfectly frames the left side of the image.</td>', 'Talk about simple yet on the mark.  I really like the use of light on the shear.  The cropping to must include the whole door perfectly frames the left side of the image.', '2006-10-30 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975478, 419181, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favorite shot in the whole challenge.  I would give a 20 if it were possible.  The motion of the windmill set against the amazing sunset rules the day.  The cropping is also excellent - the top of the blades and the top of the circle missing increase the visual.</td>', 'This is my absolute favorite shot in the whole challenge.  I would give a 20 if it were possible.  The motion of the windmill set against the amazing sunset rules the day.  The cropping is also excellent - the top of the blades and the top of the circle missing increase the visual.', '2006-10-30 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975479, 418521, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo - I love your positioning so that the sun is just of screen.</td>', 'Excellent photo - I love your positioning so that the sun is just of screen.', '2006-10-30 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975481, 418689, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image.  The contrast of the dark sky and the white fence with the blowing grasses really comes alive.  Now, if I can just find Pooh and Piglet!</td>', 'Very dramatic image.  The contrast of the dark sky and the white fence with the blowing grasses really comes alive.  Now, if I can just find Pooh and Piglet!', '2006-10-30 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975482, 419299, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The image of the shifting sands really meets the challenge.  10</td>', 'Great capture.  The image of the shifting sands really meets the challenge.  10', '2006-10-30 11:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975490, 419319, 35545, '<td valign="top">One of the few pictures that really looks like it was taken in the wind, but is it so windy that it''s blowing the lighthouse to the right?  8)  I like the b&amp;w.  Makes it feel like a cold winter day.</td>', 'One of the few pictures that really looks like it was taken in the wind, but is it so windy that it''s blowing the lighthouse to the right?  8)  I like the b&w.  Makes it feel like a cold winter day.', '2006-10-30 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975493, 417692, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good bird shot, but nothing here indicates wind to me.</td>', 'Good bird shot, but nothing here indicates wind to me.', '2006-10-30 11:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975500, 418842, 36606, '<td valign="top">Larus?</td>', 'Larus?', '2006-10-30 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975502, 417381, 67152, '<td valign="top">The perspective of the image is great - low to the ground with a wide angle lense  - but the image it is just too dark on my screen to see the reference to wind.</td>', 'The perspective of the image is great - low to the ground with a wide angle lense  - but the image it is just too dark on my screen to see the reference to wind.', '2006-10-30 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975503, 418774, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the colors on this photo</td>', 'I like the colors on this photo', '2006-10-30 11:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975507, 417900, 67152, '<td valign="top">The image appears out of focus on my screen - even the gray decking seems a little fuzzy.  I would have recommended turning the dog around and having it face into the wind and see the expression on its face.</td>', 'The image appears out of focus on my screen - even the gray decking seems a little fuzzy.  I would have recommended turning the dog around and having it face into the wind and see the expression on its face.', '2006-10-30 11:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975515, 419391, 67152, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept of kinetics with this photo as it relates to wind - but everything being so blurry will make it difficult to score well.  =</td>', 'I understand the concept of kinetics with this photo as it relates to wind - but everything being so blurry will make it difficult to score well.  =', '2006-10-30 11:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975518, 419120, 67152, '<td valign="top">This picture does not come off well on the screen.  I can''t tell which leaves are in motion and which ones are still.</td>', 'This picture does not come off well on the screen.  I can''t tell which leaves are in motion and which ones are still.', '2006-10-30 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975519, 419254, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait - but this photo does not show me or typify the wind.</td>', 'Very nice portrait - but this photo does not show me or typify the wind.', '2006-10-30 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975520, 419206, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but there are too many leaves to come across well in the photo</td>', 'Nice idea - but there are too many leaves to come across well in the photo', '2006-10-30 11:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975522, 418990, 67152, '<td valign="top">The image is too dark to see where wind is a major player. If I were to look at this photo without the title or knowing it was in the wind challenge, I would think this was a nice portrait of an attractive woman in a winter coat.  The connection to wind seems a little to subtle to score well.</td>', 'The image is too dark to see where wind is a major player. If I were to look at this photo without the title or knowing it was in the wind challenge, I would think this was a nice portrait of an attractive woman in a winter coat.  The connection to wind seems a little to subtle to score well.', '2006-10-30 11:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975524, 419388, 67152, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting - but the image is way too dark and the movement of the are and the skin on the hand really don''t come off.  Nice try!</td>', 'The idea is interesting - but the image is way too dark and the movement of the are and the skin on the hand really don''t come off.  Nice try!', '2006-10-30 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975549, 418623, 67671, '<td valign="top">love this shot, colour, contrast, and proportion, just go so well, over enhanced look may put some people off.</td>', 'love this shot, colour, contrast, and proportion, just go so well, over enhanced look may put some people off.', '2006-10-30 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975575, 419225, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is too busy for me.</td>', 'This is too busy for me.', '2006-10-30 11:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975578, 418952, 58728, '<td valign="top">Great movement in this shot.  We really get a sense of wind.  Nice composition as well.</td>', 'Great movement in this shot.  We really get a sense of wind.  Nice composition as well.', '2006-10-30 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975580, 418521, 58728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and movement.  We really get a sense of wind.  Excellent compsosition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and movement.  We really get a sense of wind.  Excellent compsosition.', '2006-10-30 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975585, 418815, 67006, '<td valign="top">Great photo, except for the lone leaf obscuring her face....too bad!</td>', 'Great photo, except for the lone leaf obscuring her face....too bad!', '2006-10-30 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975586, 417172, 29293, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked it better flipped on the vertical access, the stars in the upper right</td>', 'i think i would have liked it better flipped on the vertical access, the stars in the upper right', '2006-10-30 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975602, 419327, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I don''t see any evidence of wind.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I don''t see any evidence of wind.', '2006-10-30 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975614, 419358, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and example of the theme. I also like the comp.  Could be a bit lighter.</td>', 'Nice tones and example of the theme. I also like the comp.  Could be a bit lighter.', '2006-10-30 12:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975621, 418341, 67006, '<td valign="top">You need the effect of the wind pressing pant legs back against legs for this to really work.  Good idea, though.</td>', 'You need the effect of the wind pressing pant legs back against legs for this to really work.  Good idea, though.', '2006-10-30 12:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975627, 419087, 67006, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like a "super dog" shot.  Fun and interesting, just needs the cape!</td>', 'Kinda looks like a "super dog" shot.  Fun and interesting, just needs the cape!', '2006-10-30 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1);
