(2975724, 418969, 14614, '<td valign="top">the white stands out against the sky -- nicely composed -- one of my ribbon picks (how did you do the border? -- it really looks like a frame)</td>', 'the white stands out against the sky -- nicely composed -- one of my ribbon picks (how did you do the border? -- it really looks like a frame)', '2006-10-30 12:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
