(2975819, 417827, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge      2/2<br/>Creativity           1/3<br/>Technical            2/2<br/>Composition          1/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/>Total: 6<br/> <br/>The lighting is great and your composition is pretty good, but I would have liked to see you get in closer to the windmills and fill more of the frame with that.</td>', 'Meets Challenge      2/2Creativity           1/3Technical            2/2Composition          1/2New idea/technique   0/1Total: 6 The lighting is great and your composition is pretty good, but I would have liked to see you get in closer to the windmills and fill more of the frame with that.', '2006-10-30 13:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975828, 419382, 67698, '<td valign="top">This is nice and interesting shot - certainly evokes a windy feeling. The face is dark and underexposed - was that intended?<br/> <br/>Something demonic about that red sky and horn-like strings of hair :)</td>', 'This is nice and interesting shot - certainly evokes a windy feeling. The face is dark and underexposed - was that intended? Something demonic about that red sky and horn-like strings of hair :)', '2006-10-30 13:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975851, 417172, 59276, '<td valign="top">great color and light...my fav of the flags</td>', 'great color and light...my fav of the flags', '2006-10-30 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975854, 418914, 59276, '<td valign="top">I like what you did to this pic</td>', 'I like what you did to this pic', '2006-10-30 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
