(2975857, 417819, 59276, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the blades and the small amount of green in the center</td>', 'I like the color of the blades and the small amount of green in the center', '2006-10-30 14:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975858, 418309, 59276, '<td valign="top">you caught the dance of the leaves!!</td>', 'you caught the dance of the leaves!!', '2006-10-30 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975860, 419339, 59276, '<td valign="top">nice do</td>', 'nice do', '2006-10-30 14:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975868, 418468, 59276, '<td valign="top">I really love clouds like these...good job</td>', 'I really love clouds like these...good job', '2006-10-30 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975871, 417592, 59276, '<td valign="top">oh no</td>', 'oh no', '2006-10-30 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975902, 418866, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge 1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  1/1<br/>Creativity           1/3<br/>Technical           1/2<br/>Composition      1/2<br/>New Technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Total:  5<br/> <br/>Your subject matter is cool and different.  I like your viewpoint, that you got in close and filled the frame with the subject.  The business of the background is pretty distracting, and the seeds on the right kind of blend in with them.  Maybe a little flash would bring those out and freeze them if they are in action.</td>', 'Meets challenge 1/1Focus is on challenge subject  1/1Creativity           1/3Technical           1/2Composition      1/2New Technique   0/1 Total:  5 Your subject matter is cool and different.  I like your viewpoint, that you got in close and filled the frame with the subject.  The business of the background is pretty distracting, and the seeds on the right kind of blend in with them.  Maybe a little flash would bring those out and freeze them if they are in action.', '2006-10-30 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975915, 419197, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot: color, composition, lighting. While I can see that the petals are blown up, I wouldn''t think of wind if I didn''t know the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot: color, composition, lighting. While I can see that the petals are blown up, I wouldn''t think of wind if I didn''t know the challenge.', '2006-10-30 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975917, 418999, 66384, '<td valign="top">Could use more color. It''s a great tree and good composition.</td>', 'Could use more color. It''s a great tree and good composition.', '2006-10-30 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975920, 419300, 66384, '<td valign="top">You captured the wind on this one!</td>', 'You captured the wind on this one!', '2006-10-30 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975923, 419339, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cute girl, nice lighting, good wind.</td>', 'Cute girl, nice lighting, good wind.', '2006-10-30 14:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975925, 418198, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea, and well done.</td>', 'Very interesting idea, and well done.', '2006-10-30 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975930, 419194, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-10-30 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975938, 418443, 66193, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!  Nice take on the challenge.', '2006-10-30 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2975939, 419293, 66384, '<td valign="top">I know what you''re trying to do, but just looks like a blurry photo. Also the highlights are blown out.</td>', 'I know what you''re trying to do, but just looks like a blurry photo. Also the highlights are blown out.', '2006-10-30 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
