(2975950, 419178, 66384, '<td valign="top">Shades of Marylin Monroe. Very nice contrast, and checks and stripes make wonderful patterns. I really like this.</td>', 'Shades of Marylin Monroe. Very nice contrast, and checks and stripes make wonderful patterns. I really like this.', '2006-10-30 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
