(2976076, 419178, 32869, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Just in time for that Halloween look.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Just in time for that Halloween look.', '2006-10-30 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976079, 418869, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think a few more leaves would have added to the "effect" part. Good placement of the wheels.</td>', 'I think a few more leaves would have added to the "effect" part. Good placement of the wheels.', '2006-10-30 15:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976084, 419087, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. I think you shutter speed was set too high, since everything is frozen. It could have been taking on a black matt for all I know. But really good idea.</td>', 'I like the concept. I think you shutter speed was set too high, since everything is frozen. It could have been taking on a black matt for all I know. But really good idea.', '2006-10-30 15:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976085, 416768, 62318, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Maybe a bit more contrast. Still, it works well for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture. Maybe a bit more contrast. Still, it works well for the challenge.', '2006-10-30 15:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976087, 418689, 32869, '<td valign="top">Very moving image and B/W really makes it show emotion as well as motion.</td>', 'Very moving image and B/W really makes it show emotion as well as motion.', '2006-10-30 15:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976088, 419275, 62318, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the saturation. People look red to me. However, I do like the idea and over composition. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom to highlight more of the great cloud cover.</td>', 'Not sure I like the saturation. People look red to me. However, I do like the idea and over composition. Maybe crop a bit off the bottom to highlight more of the great cloud cover.', '2006-10-30 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976095, 419361, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the angle is too high. I like the idea and thought though. The contrasting colors work well.</td>', 'I think the angle is too high. I like the idea and thought though. The contrasting colors work well.', '2006-10-30 15:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976096, 419331, 62318, '<td valign="top">As a landscape it is a winner, but I think wind is taking a back seat here.</td>', 'As a landscape it is a winner, but I think wind is taking a back seat here.', '2006-10-30 15:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976099, 417819, 32869, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  It gives the impression that the windmill is going to cut right out of the frame. The blue sky makes the yellow pop.</td>', 'I like this one.  It gives the impression that the windmill is going to cut right out of the frame. The blue sky makes the yellow pop.', '2006-10-30 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976117, 419318, 62318, '<td valign="top">Heat rises, but I guess that is a function of wind. The capture is nice. I like the dark blue going with the gray.</td>', 'Heat rises, but I guess that is a function of wind. The capture is nice. I like the dark blue going with the gray.', '2006-10-30 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976122, 415901, 62318, '<td valign="top">Too much dead space for me. The color is nice.</td>', 'Too much dead space for me. The color is nice.', '2006-10-30 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976124, 418309, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think either more leaves are in order, or a slower shutter speed so you can watch them twirl more. The idea is good.</td>', 'I think either more leaves are in order, or a slower shutter speed so you can watch them twirl more. The idea is good.', '2006-10-30 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976185, 417447, 61705, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge. I see where you''re coming from and I like the laid back feel here. Well executed.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge. I see where you''re coming from and I like the laid back feel here. Well executed.', '2006-10-30 16:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976192, 419299, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the sand in motion. Looks like the winds where around ~25-30mph. Only nitpick is the editing, the unevening burning of the clouds kind of spoils the shot. I do like the rest of the tone of the image.</td>', 'Great job capturing the sand in motion. Looks like the winds where around ~25-30mph. Only nitpick is the editing, the unevening burning of the clouds kind of spoils the shot. I do like the rest of the tone of the image.', '2006-10-30 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976201, 418842, 61705, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. Great work with light. I don''t think the vignette was necessary here. I would have preferred to see the blue carry on to the edges of the frame, however, it doesn''t lessen the fact that this is a stunning image, well worth a ribbon.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. Great work with light. I don''t think the vignette was necessary here. I would have preferred to see the blue carry on to the edges of the frame, however, it doesn''t lessen the fact that this is a stunning image, well worth a ribbon.', '2006-10-30 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976222, 418752, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good shot. The wind is wrong though - the umbrella is blowing right and her hair is blowing left. Oh, she must be in a whirlwind.</td>', 'Great idea and good shot. The wind is wrong though - the umbrella is blowing right and her hair is blowing left. Oh, she must be in a whirlwind.', '2006-10-30 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976234, 418162, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and the border adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Lovely shot, and the border adds a nice touch.', '2006-10-30 16:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976244, 419113, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge 1/1<br/>Focus on challenge subject 1/1<br/>Technical 2/2<br/>Composition 2/2<br/>Creativity 2/3<br/>New technique/idea that''s never been tried 0/1<br/>Total:  8<br/> <br/>The colors work well together.  I like the blur of the strings on the fan, although it looks a little manipulated instead of pure slow shutter speed.  Which isn''t necessarily bad.  I just like the movement.</td>', 'Meets challenge 1/1Focus on challenge subject 1/1Technical 2/2Composition 2/2Creativity 2/3New technique/idea that''s never been tried 0/1Total:  8 The colors work well together.  I like the blur of the strings on the fan, although it looks a little manipulated instead of pure slow shutter speed.  Which isn''t necessarily bad.  I just like the movement.', '2006-10-30 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976250, 416167, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very funny, and good shot.</td>', 'Great idea, very funny, and good shot.', '2006-10-30 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976252, 418871, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:  1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1<br/>Creativity:  1/3<br/>Composition 1/2<br/>Technical: 1/2<br/>New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1<br/> <br/>Total:  4<br/> <br/>I think it''s a neat idea to take  the approack of "sculpted by the wind" instead of the wind itself, but I do think that without the title the photo wouldn''t say "wind" to me.  I would have liked to see the tombstone on the left sharp and in focus as well.  As far as creativity, I think the approach is creative but I would have liked to see creativity in angle, composition, etc.</td>', 'Meets challenge:  1/1Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1Creativity:  1/3Composition 1/2Technical: 1/2New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1 Total:  4 I think it''s a neat idea to take  the approack of "sculpted by the wind" instead of the wind itself, but I do think that without the title the photo wouldn''t say "wind" to me.  I would have liked to see the tombstone on the left sharp and in focus as well.  As far as creativity, I think the approach is creative but I would have liked to see creativity in angle, composition, etc.', '2006-10-30 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976256, 418630, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2006-10-30 16:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976276, 418891, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:  1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1<br/>Creativity:  1/3<br/>Composition 1/2<br/>Technical: 1/2<br/>New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1<br/>Extra/less points:  +1 <br/> <br/>Total:  5<br/> <br/>This image is interesting to me because the "blizzard" can signify what the person in it must be feeling.  I like that it has that sort of "deeper meaning" (+1) to it.  I would have liked to see this photo in black and white, because the green of the tree above the person is kind of distracting.  Also, there are some blue splotches on the base of the tree to the right.  I''m not sure if that''s my monitor, or what''s going on.  (technical)</td>', 'Meets challenge:  1/1Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1Creativity:  1/3Composition 1/2Technical: 1/2New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1Extra/less points:  +1  Total:  5 This image is interesting to me because the "blizzard" can signify what the person in it must be feeling.  I like that it has that sort of "deeper meaning" (+1) to it.  I would have liked to see this photo in black and white, because the green of the tree above the person is kind of distracting.  Also, there are some blue splotches on the base of the tree to the right.  I''m not sure if that''s my monitor, or what''s going on.  (technical)', '2006-10-30 17:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976283, 419367, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:  1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1<br/>Creativity:  1/3<br/>Composition 1/2<br/>Technical: 2/2<br/>New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/Less ponts: none<br/> <br/>Total:  5<br/> <br/>I like the texture of the lighting on the roofs of the houses; the time of day you picked worked out well, and made the sail boats stand out a little more than if it were at a different time.  You used the rule of thirds well, but the composition is a little symetrical to me.  I would have liked to see the sailboats spread out a little different.  I know you don''t have control of where they go, but maybe if you waited a few minutes one of the boats would have came closer.</td>', 'Meets challenge:  1/1Focus is on challenge subject:  0/1Creativity:  1/3Composition 1/2Technical: 2/2New technique (idea that''s never been tried) 0/1 Extra/Less ponts: none Total:  5 I like the texture of the lighting on the roofs of the houses; the time of day you picked worked out well, and made the sail boats stand out a little more than if it were at a different time.  You used the rule of thirds well, but the composition is a little symetrical to me.  I would have liked to see the sailboats spread out a little different.  I know you don''t have control of where they go, but maybe if you waited a few minutes one of the boats would have came closer.', '2006-10-30 17:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976324, 419395, 36371, '<td valign="top">I knew we''d see these. Nice capture. 8</td>', 'I knew we''d see these. Nice capture. 8', '2006-10-30 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976388, 418621, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challeng       1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  0/1<br/>Creativity           1/3<br/>Technical            2/2<br/>Composition          2/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/less points:  none<br/> <br/>Total: 6<br/> <br/>Beautiful lighting!  The contrast is great, and the subtlty (Sp?) of the color is great.  As you can see, my voting relies heavily on creativity, which is harder said than done.  It is designed to push photographers to a new level. Your photo is great, but I have seen many similar before.  All it needs is that extra edge to push it even farther and make it stand out from the others.</td>', 'Meets challeng       1/1Focus is on challenge subject  0/1Creativity           1/3Technical            2/2Composition          2/2New idea/technique   0/1 Extra/less points:  none Total: 6 Beautiful lighting!  The contrast is great, and the subtlty (Sp?) of the color is great.  As you can see, my voting relies heavily on creativity, which is harder said than done.  It is designed to push photographers to a new level. Your photo is great, but I have seen many similar before.  All it needs is that extra edge to push it even farther and make it stand out from the others.', '2006-10-30 17:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976404, 418521, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, beautiful display of the wind''s power, one of my favourites.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, beautiful display of the wind''s power, one of my favourites.', '2006-10-30 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976413, 419339, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challeng       1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  1/1<br/>Creativity           2/3<br/>Technical            2/2<br/>Composition          1/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/less points:  none<br/> <br/>Total: 7<br/> <br/>Beautiful lighting!  I love the outline on the right, and ofcourse the hair (I''m a motion blur freak).  A slower shutter speed might emphasize the wind even more.  I would mess around with the cropping to make the hair more of the subject.  You could crop the bottom off so everything below the eyes is cropped.  I''m not trying to tell you hat to do with your images, I''m just trying to help you push the composition.</td>', 'Meets challeng       1/1Focus is on challenge subject  1/1Creativity           2/3Technical            2/2Composition          1/2New idea/technique   0/1 Extra/less points:  none Total: 7 Beautiful lighting!  I love the outline on the right, and ofcourse the hair (I''m a motion blur freak).  A slower shutter speed might emphasize the wind even more.  I would mess around with the cropping to make the hair more of the subject.  You could crop the bottom off so everything below the eyes is cropped.  I''m not trying to tell you hat to do with your images, I''m just trying to help you push the composition.', '2006-10-30 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976422, 419124, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challeng       1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  0/1<br/>Creativity           2/3<br/>Technical            1/2<br/>Composition          1/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/less points:  none<br/> <br/>Total: 5<br/> <br/>Kudos on being creative with the subject matter.  I think the over exposure on the girl works because of the concept/title.  I would have liked to see that idea pushed further, maybe by making the entire image extremely overexposed, so over exposed you can only see some details.  Also, I think the idea of the wind could be more emphasized.  You could use a slower shutter speed so that the scarf and hair has motion blur.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Meets challeng       1/1Focus is on challenge subject  0/1Creativity           2/3Technical            1/2Composition          1/2New idea/technique   0/1 Extra/less points:  none Total: 5 Kudos on being creative with the subject matter.  I think the over exposure on the girl works because of the concept/title.  I would have liked to see that idea pushed further, maybe by making the entire image extremely overexposed, so over exposed you can only see some details.  Also, I think the idea of the wind could be more emphasized.  You could use a slower shutter speed so that the scarf and hair has motion blur.  Just a thought.', '2006-10-30 18:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976424, 417819, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur.  The sky against the back of the windmill looks a touch unnatural - is there a lot of levels or saturation in the PP here?  Anyway, good shot.</td>', 'Nice motion blur.  The sky against the back of the windmill looks a touch unnatural - is there a lot of levels or saturation in the PP here?  Anyway, good shot.', '2006-10-30 18:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976425, 418184, 65858, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is great (clever twist - most of the hair-blown models are ladies).  I think it simply falls a little short technically.  The focus could be a bit crisper, and the color is a bit flat.<br/> <br/>Note: revisiting on a nicer monitor shows better color after all.</td>', 'I think this shot is great (clever twist - most of the hair-blown models are ladies).  I think it simply falls a little short technically.  The focus could be a bit crisper, and the color is a bit flat. Note: revisiting on a nicer monitor shows better color after all.', '2006-10-30 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976428, 418498, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot.  The glasses almost look real on my monitor.  Good tonal range.  I might have liked a touch more light from the front, but that''s a debatable nit.<br/> <br/>Overall excellent!  (You probably wish I could vote in this challenge.  =)</td>', 'Nice crisp shot.  The glasses almost look real on my monitor.  Good tonal range.  I might have liked a touch more light from the front, but that''s a debatable nit. Overall excellent!  (You probably wish I could vote in this challenge.  =)', '2006-10-30 18:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976429, 418815, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challeng       1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  1/1<br/>Creativity           2/3<br/>Technical            2/2<br/>Composition          1/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/less points:  <b>+1</b> Taking an overused photo (girl with umbrella and leaves) and making it new (blury leaves)<br/> <br/>I''m sure you''re getting this a lot, but that one leaf on the face is distracting.  I either want see the entire face or see none of it, not part of it.  <br/> <br/>Total: 8</td>', 'Meets challeng       1/1Focus is on challenge subject  1/1Creativity           2/3Technical            2/2Composition          1/2New idea/technique   0/1 Extra/less points:  +1 Taking an overused photo (girl with umbrella and leaves) and making it new (blury leaves) I''m sure you''re getting this a lot, but that one leaf on the face is distracting.  I either want see the entire face or see none of it, not part of it.   Total: 8', '2006-10-30 18:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976443, 419120, 48890, '<td valign="top">Aren''t those suckers hard to photograph?  Sorry, I don''t feel movement in this picture. :(</td>', 'Aren''t those suckers hard to photograph?  Sorry, I don''t feel movement in this picture. :(', '2006-10-30 18:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976446, 418793, 48890, '<td valign="top">Well, I see the *aftermath* of a big wind, can''t see the wind in this picture.</td>', 'Well, I see the *aftermath* of a big wind, can''t see the wind in this picture.', '2006-10-30 18:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976450, 419050, 48890, '<td valign="top">The blue sky spoils it - the blue patches distract a lot.</td>', 'The blue sky spoils it - the blue patches distract a lot.', '2006-10-30 18:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976459, 418969, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not often we actually see a sailboat shot where the sails are properly trimmed :-) This is soothing.</td>', 'Not often we actually see a sailboat shot where the sails are properly trimmed :-) This is soothing.', '2006-10-30 18:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976460, 419050, 65025, '<td valign="top">Meets challeng       1/1<br/>Focus is on challenge subject  1/1<br/>Creativity           3/3<br/>Technical            1/2<br/>Composition          0/2<br/>New idea/technique   0/1<br/> <br/>Extra/less points:  none<br/> <br/>Total: 6<br/> <br/>Great creativity.  Its brave to submit an image like this as I''m sure you either know or are finding out.  Most people don''t like the different images that break the rules.  I do.  Those are my favorite, and those kinds of photos make certain photographers stand out.  While your photo is very creative (the first 3 in creativity for me so far), I think the compositional element isn''t really there.  It''s the exact oposite of what most people have.  I would work on trying different areas with different branch sequences, maybe zooming in during the exposure, or using a tripod so the branches are clear, or maybe using a slow shutter speed and flash. Experimenting with tons of ideas can really be fun.</td>', 'Meets challeng       1/1Focus is on challenge subject  1/1Creativity           3/3Technical            1/2Composition          0/2New idea/technique   0/1 Extra/less points:  none Total: 6 Great creativity.  Its brave to submit an image like this as I''m sure you either know or are finding out.  Most people don''t like the different images that break the rules.  I do.  Those are my favorite, and those kinds of photos make certain photographers stand out.  While your photo is very creative (the first 3 in creativity for me so far), I think the compositional element isn''t really there.  It''s the exact oposite of what most people have.  I would work on trying different areas with different branch sequences, maybe zooming in during the exposure, or using a tripod so the branches are clear, or maybe using a slow shutter speed and flash. Experimenting with tons of ideas can really be fun.', '2006-10-30 18:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976461, 419155, 48890, '<td valign="top">How did you twist the asphalt like that?  I get dizzy from looking at it. +2 for such interaction with the viewer.  I like the way the dog came out - it''s the long exposure.  I am not sure I like/get the composition in this shot.</td>', 'How did you twist the asphalt like that?  I get dizzy from looking at it. +2 for such interaction with the viewer.  I like the way the dog came out - it''s the long exposure.  I am not sure I like/get the composition in this shot.', '2006-10-30 18:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976471, 416120, 30861, '<td valign="top">Helluva sunrise! It doesn''t really speak directly to me of "wind" or even "breeze", it''s more like a calm to me, but I do know the clouds are arranged by the wind... Anyway it''s lovely :-)</td>', 'Helluva sunrise! It doesn''t really speak directly to me of "wind" or even "breeze", it''s more like a calm to me, but I do know the clouds are arranged by the wind... Anyway it''s lovely :-)', '2006-10-30 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
