(2976636, 418966, 14476, '<td valign="top">The trees in the wind contrast perfectly with the stationary structure to the right.  Very well done.  <br/> <br/>Something seems odd,though, about the clouds.  Especially to the right of the image...Without those darker clouds (and if that''s Mother Nature, too bad) this could be a front pager.  Maybe it still will be.</td>', 'The trees in the wind contrast perfectly with the stationary structure to the right.  Very well done.   Something seems odd,though, about the clouds.  Especially to the right of the image...Without those darker clouds (and if that''s Mother Nature, too bad) this could be a front pager.  Maybe it still will be.', '2006-10-30 19:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976639, 418815, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  The effect of the wind is well shown, with plenty of stationary stuff to ''anchor'' us to reality.</td>', 'Terrific.  The effect of the wind is well shown, with plenty of stationary stuff to ''anchor'' us to reality.', '2006-10-30 19:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976640, 418842, 62024, '<td valign="top">Just beautyful</td>', 'Just beautyful', '2006-10-30 19:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976651, 419181, 14476, '<td valign="top">GREAT Idea.  Color a little strange for my taste.<br/>But beautifully composed and striking angle.  Good job.</td>', 'GREAT Idea.  Color a little strange for my taste.But beautifully composed and striking angle.  Good job.', '2006-10-30 19:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976653, 417819, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Nice angle, good colors and use of polarizer (or equivalent).</td>', 'Very well done.  Nice angle, good colors and use of polarizer (or equivalent).', '2006-10-30 19:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976655, 419155, 61818, '<td valign="top">Must have been a very strong wind to cause the asphalt to shift like that...</td>', 'Must have been a very strong wind to cause the asphalt to shift like that...', '2006-10-30 19:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976659, 419344, 61818, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  A little on the flat side as far as tones go and it would look a lot better were the model not blurred.  Neat shot though, different from the bulk of the entries and that''s a good thing all on its own.</td>', 'Interesting.  A little on the flat side as far as tones go and it would look a lot better were the model not blurred.  Neat shot though, different from the bulk of the entries and that''s a good thing all on its own.', '2006-10-30 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976660, 418499, 14476, '<td valign="top">Certainly shows the effects of winds perfectly.  Compositionally,<br/>I wonder if it would have been a stronger image without the foreground shadow.</td>', 'Certainly shows the effects of winds perfectly.  Compositionally,I wonder if it would have been a stronger image without the foreground shadow.', '2006-10-30 19:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976663, 417768, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is sort of cool as an abstract.  On the whole, I think you went a bit long on the exposure.  There''s timing to illustrate the movement, and then there''s a point where it just becomes a messy blur.</td>', 'This is sort of cool as an abstract.  On the whole, I think you went a bit long on the exposure.  There''s timing to illustrate the movement, and then there''s a point where it just becomes a messy blur.', '2006-10-30 19:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976664, 416147, 61818, '<td valign="top">I was going to say how pathetically boring this photo is, then I see it''s of Illinois so what else could it be really.  I empathize with your situation.</td>', 'I was going to say how pathetically boring this photo is, then I see it''s of Illinois so what else could it be really.  I empathize with your situation.', '2006-10-30 19:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976667, 418341, 14476, '<td valign="top">Marcel Marceau would be proud of you.  I know I am.<br/> <br/>Good one.  Um, maybeee a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Marcel Marceau would be proud of you.  I know I am. Good one.  Um, maybeee a little oversharpened.', '2006-10-30 19:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976669, 418793, 61818, '<td valign="top">Cool subject and overall the composition is interesting.  Looks underexposed though, even for a stormy day.</td>', 'Cool subject and overall the composition is interesting.  Looks underexposed though, even for a stormy day.', '2006-10-30 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976673, 419019, 45475, '<td valign="top">The colours here appeal to me. It''s almost like selective desat. Lovely comp/subject matter and great exposure.</td>', 'The colours here appeal to me. It''s almost like selective desat. Lovely comp/subject matter and great exposure.', '2006-10-30 19:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976674, 417348, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely emotive image.  <br/>Marred slightly by the uneven horizon.</td>', 'Lovely emotive image.  Marred slightly by the uneven horizon.', '2006-10-30 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976677, 419275, 61818, '<td valign="top">A sky full of processing gone wrong.  Otherwise a nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'A sky full of processing gone wrong.  Otherwise a nice photo.  Good luck.', '2006-10-30 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976679, 419303, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The disembodied wick was a fantastic score! Well done.</td>', 'Great capture. The disembodied wick was a fantastic score! Well done.', '2006-10-30 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976682, 419050, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful art. The colour mix is beautiful. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful art. The colour mix is beautiful. Nicely done.', '2006-10-30 19:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976683, 419181, 61818, '<td valign="top">Less border, more windmill.  Cool shot, good luck.</td>', 'Less border, more windmill.  Cool shot, good luck.', '2006-10-30 19:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976688, 419155, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea, but the pavement blur along with the dog<br/>blur is hard to relate to the wind theme.<br/>The dog looks as if it''s time to play, not pose.<br/>;-)</td>', 'Sweet idea, but the pavement blur along with the dogblur is hard to relate to the wind theme.The dog looks as if it''s time to play, not pose.;-)', '2006-10-30 20:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976692, 418577, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very nice that you found a place where you could isolate<br/>some stationary objects along with the windblown parts.<br/>Gives it balance.  Good one.</td>', 'Very nice that you found a place where you could isolatesome stationary objects along with the windblown parts.Gives it balance.  Good one.', '2006-10-30 20:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976704, 418999, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and certainly shows the action of the wind in forming the tree.  If it was mine (and I know it isn''t)  I''d probably have cropped down a touch on the left side to concentrate on the tree...</td>', 'Very pretty and certainly shows the action of the wind in forming the tree.  If it was mine (and I know it isn''t)  I''d probably have cropped down a touch on the left side to concentrate on the tree...', '2006-10-30 20:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976707, 419171, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, this is a different take on the Challenge.  <br/>Very,very nice.  The spare composition and the <br/>Black n white fits this perfectly.</td>', 'Ohhh, this is a different take on the Challenge.  Very,very nice.  The spare composition and the Black n white fits this perfectly.', '2006-10-30 20:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976712, 417041, 14476, '<td valign="top">Marcel Marceau would be proud of your model.<br/>Nice setup and cute idea.  Well photographed, of course.</td>', 'Marcel Marceau would be proud of your model.Nice setup and cute idea.  Well photographed, of course.', '2006-10-30 20:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976720, 419275, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  <br/>Interesting colors. Especially that sky. Um, seems a bit unreal. <br/>Good interpretation of the Challenge with the kite.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Interesting colors. Especially that sky. Um, seems a bit unreal. Good interpretation of the Challenge with the kite.', '2006-10-30 20:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976723, 418823, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the Challenge.  Wish more of the leaves were<br/>in focus...</td>', 'Nice take on the Challenge.  Wish more of the leaves werein focus...', '2006-10-30 20:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976725, 419296, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Maybe a little sharper would make this<br/>work even better.</td>', 'Great idea.  Maybe a little sharper would make thiswork even better.', '2006-10-30 20:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976743, 416147, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, you can feel the wind whistling in this one.  Very nice composition. And take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Oh, you can feel the wind whistling in this one.  Very nice composition. And take on the Challenge.', '2006-10-30 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976782, 418869, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the feeling of movement doesn''t really come through. I can see a few leaves moving, but they are obscured by the large number sitting still.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the feeling of movement doesn''t really come through. I can see a few leaves moving, but they are obscured by the large number sitting still.', '2006-10-30 20:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976786, 419141, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very magical and mysterious. Nice use of low key, dark atmosphere.</td>', 'Very magical and mysterious. Nice use of low key, dark atmosphere.', '2006-10-30 20:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2976791, 419395, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. A little blur on the blades would really show they are blowing.</td>', 'Nice concept. A little blur on the blades would really show they are blowing.', '2006-10-30 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
