(2977031, 419113, 64928, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, good focus, nice colors and composition, maybe a little lacking in wow factor, but a good photo.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, good focus, nice colors and composition, maybe a little lacking in wow factor, but a good photo.', '2006-10-30 21:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
