(2977346, 418999, 65468, '<td valign="top">Image appears to be a result of long exposure of the tree to the effects of wind but the grass in the forground is straight and unaffected.  I don''t feel action.</td>', 'Image appears to be a result of long exposure of the tree to the effects of wind but the grass in the forground is straight and unaffected.  I don''t feel action.', '2006-10-30 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977352, 419367, 66398, '<td valign="top">I had a couple of sailboat shots that had spinakers up but, I didn''t like the background so I went with something different. I like yours  I would have given even more with spinakers up but, you don''t have control over that.  Good contrast, color, focus, and it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I had a couple of sailboat shots that had spinakers up but, I didn''t like the background so I went with something different. I like yours  I would have given even more with spinakers up but, you don''t have control over that.  Good contrast, color, focus, and it meets the challenge well.', '2006-10-30 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977357, 418452, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and comp, but I think the resize has left you with a lot of jaggies :( Not sure what advice to give as this has happened to me before as well, and I still have no clue why.</td>', 'Nice colour and comp, but I think the resize has left you with a lot of jaggies :( Not sure what advice to give as this has happened to me before as well, and I still have no clue why.', '2006-10-30 23:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977359, 419192, 65468, '<td valign="top">Nice soft picture for a soft breeze.  For me it would be improved if the vertical lines of the window were straightened. Very pleasant to look at.</td>', 'Nice soft picture for a soft breeze.  For me it would be improved if the vertical lines of the window were straightened. Very pleasant to look at.', '2006-10-30 23:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977363, 419155, 45475, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this has been done in post or in camera. Either way, you''ve achieved a sense of movement which implies windiness. Nice :)</td>', 'Can''t tell if this has been done in post or in camera. Either way, you''ve achieved a sense of movement which implies windiness. Nice :)', '2006-10-30 23:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977368, 419119, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and great picture but, I think for the challenge you might have gotten higher scores if the focal point was more with the sailboat.  I first notice the water and the contrast then after seeing the title I noticed the boat.  Being about wind you might crop, enlarge, and enhance the silhouetted sailboat for more impact.</td>', 'Nice idea and great picture but, I think for the challenge you might have gotten higher scores if the focal point was more with the sailboat.  I first notice the water and the contrast then after seeing the title I noticed the boat.  Being about wind you might crop, enlarge, and enhance the silhouetted sailboat for more impact.', '2006-10-30 23:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977375, 419117, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s pretty choppy. I like the idea, however the sky seems to be badly exposed. Having said that though, I do like to see cyan in skies as it''s more realistic than the over-saturated blues.</td>', 'Yup, that''s pretty choppy. I like the idea, however the sky seems to be badly exposed. Having said that though, I do like to see cyan in skies as it''s more realistic than the over-saturated blues.', '2006-10-30 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977376, 418184, 65468, '<td valign="top">Almost as much tempest in the eye of the horse as in the strength of the wind.  Good image for this challenge.</td>', 'Almost as much tempest in the eye of the horse as in the strength of the wind.  Good image for this challenge.', '2006-10-30 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
