(2977413, 417867, 45475, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fountain is silhouetted here and the backlit golden splashes of water. Just lovely. Not sure you''ve conveyed "wind" strongly enough, however for me, the image is still wonderful to view.</td>', 'I like the way the fountain is silhouetted here and the backlit golden splashes of water. Just lovely. Not sure you''ve conveyed "wind" strongly enough, however for me, the image is still wonderful to view.', '2006-10-30 23:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977414, 419380, 45475, '<td valign="top">So chic.... :) Tones are superb.</td>', 'So chic.... :) Tones are superb.', '2006-10-30 23:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977417, 419254, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.  Funny I never heard that term before that challenge and now I seem to see it everywhere.  Can''t see anything at all to improve with the photograph itself.  If it doesn''t do as well as you expected, there are a couple that capture the wind a little better.  This meets the challenge but maybe if her hair was lifted a little bit more by the breeze.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.  Funny I never heard that term before that challenge and now I seem to see it everywhere.  Can''t see anything at all to improve with the photograph itself.  If it doesn''t do as well as you expected, there are a couple that capture the wind a little better.  This meets the challenge but maybe if her hair was lifted a little bit more by the breeze.', '2006-10-30 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977425, 419107, 33672, '<td valign="top">My pick to ribbon. Spectacular capture.</td>', 'My pick to ribbon. Spectacular capture.', '2006-10-30 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977427, 418907, 45475, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strikes me here is the great dof. Then I''m taken by the tonal range. So you''re way ahead of the game even before I see the wind. Good on you, this is a lovely submission to the challange :)</td>', 'The first thing that strikes me here is the great dof. Then I''m taken by the tonal range. So you''re way ahead of the game even before I see the wind. Good on you, this is a lovely submission to the challange :)', '2006-10-30 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977429, 419395, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great composition and tones. Simple and elegant, well done.</td>', 'Great composition and tones. Simple and elegant, well done.', '2006-10-30 23:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977433, 419387, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tones and detail. Superb shot.</td>', 'Fantastic tones and detail. Superb shot.', '2006-10-30 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977435, 419254, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice portraiture - a bit much dodging in the eyes.  But great bokeh, good expression, and nice color tone.</td>', 'Nice portraiture - a bit much dodging in the eyes.  But great bokeh, good expression, and nice color tone.', '2006-10-30 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977436, 419339, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light coming through her hair. Wonderfully composed and taken, it''s a lovely candid, perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous light coming through her hair. Wonderfully composed and taken, it''s a lovely candid, perfect for the challenge.', '2006-10-30 23:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977437, 419124, 66398, '<td valign="top">I had an idea of something similiar to this but, didn''t get time to go do it.  Probably wouldn''t have been as good as yours though. I would have liked to see more space in front of her and just a tiny bit less space behind her.</td>', 'I had an idea of something similiar to this but, didn''t get time to go do it.  Probably wouldn''t have been as good as yours though. I would have liked to see more space in front of her and just a tiny bit less space behind her.', '2006-10-31 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977471, 417831, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful set up. Love the detail and tones here. Nice.</td>', 'Wonderful set up. Love the detail and tones here. Nice.', '2006-10-31 00:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977478, 419299, 45475, '<td valign="top">Sand devils are fantastic, aren''t they? Really like the comp and tones, even if they look a tad unnatural (maybe that''s why I like it?) :)</td>', 'Sand devils are fantastic, aren''t they? Really like the comp and tones, even if they look a tad unnatural (maybe that''s why I like it?) :)', '2006-10-31 00:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
