(2977610, 417041, 53316, '<td valign="top">Way too overprocessed for my tastes, but I think you did a good job with what you were trying to accomplish.</td>', 'Way too overprocessed for my tastes, but I think you did a good job with what you were trying to accomplish.', '2006-10-31 01:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977611, 416199, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh, I bet people are going to not really like this. :-(  Too out of the box, probably. Which is kind of sad.  Personally, I love it SO MUCH.  Green is my favorite color and I just ADORE how you captured the movement while still making the leaves distinct!!!  I like the grain and the contrast also.  Good luck in the challenge... and no matter how you do score wise just keep in mind that there is one person who thinks this photo ROCKS!</td>', 'Oh, I bet people are going to not really like this. :-(  Too out of the box, probably. Which is kind of sad.  Personally, I love it SO MUCH.  Green is my favorite color and I just ADORE how you captured the movement while still making the leaves distinct!!!  I like the grain and the contrast also.  Good luck in the challenge... and no matter how you do score wise just keep in mind that there is one person who thinks this photo ROCKS!', '2006-10-31 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977613, 417348, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast, the old date on the stone, and how the tilt of the horizon offsets the lines of the flag.  Great shot.</td>', 'I love the contrast, the old date on the stone, and how the tilt of the horizon offsets the lines of the flag.  Great shot.', '2006-10-31 01:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
