(2978284, 419318, 30049, '<td valign="top">A slight breeze to move the smoke could have sold this better IMO.  As is, it''s all tied to the title and doesn''t illustrate wind directly.  Nice job on exposing for the smoke, it has an interesting color cast to it near the top.</td>', 'A slight breeze to move the smoke could have sold this better IMO.  As is, it''s all tied to the title and doesn''t illustrate wind directly.  Nice job on exposing for the smoke, it has an interesting color cast to it near the top.', '2006-10-31 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978290, 417041, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love teh texture of this photo. The use of B/W and color makes this photo sing.</td>', 'I love teh texture of this photo. The use of B/W and color makes this photo sing.', '2006-10-31 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978292, 419124, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Not sure why her eyes are closed - feels a little strange that way.  The photo also seems a bit washed out and overexposed.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting.  Not sure why her eyes are closed - feels a little strange that way.  The photo also seems a bit washed out and overexposed.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978299, 418786, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great movie title.  :D  Nice color in this photo.  The connection to wind is a little thin - I understand your POV, but I think for many viewers some indication of wind actually happening at the time of image capture would sell it better.  For example, some leaves blowing off the tree captured in flight.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great movie title.  :D  Nice color in this photo.  The connection to wind is a little thin - I understand your POV, but I think for many viewers some indication of wind actually happening at the time of image capture would sell it better.  For example, some leaves blowing off the tree captured in flight.  Good luck.', '2006-10-31 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978302, 418499, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  This is pretty darn cool.  :D  I really like the shadow.  Good job on finding some unblemished sand!  The positioning of the main subjects in your photo work quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey!  This is pretty darn cool.  :D  I really like the shadow.  Good job on finding some unblemished sand!  The positioning of the main subjects in your photo work quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978310, 417041, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Will a slightly overprocessed image still do well at DPC?  Certainly time will tell with this one.  It''s a neat image (pun not originally intended, but fits) that is well thought out and fun to look at.  Given the severity of the umbrellas'' condition, your hair should be blowing around a bit more to really sell the concept.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Will a slightly overprocessed image still do well at DPC?  Certainly time will tell with this one.  It''s a neat image (pun not originally intended, but fits) that is well thought out and fun to look at.  Given the severity of the umbrellas'' condition, your hair should be blowing around a bit more to really sell the concept.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978320, 418417, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thought was aaawwwww.  :D  I had a Shelty years ago.  Lots and lots of brushing required.  He-he.  Looks like you''re doing a fine job of keeping him/her groomed and it pays off here.  I hope this gets the attention it deserves as you''ve illustrated wind at work (in two ways) in a wonderful image.  Nice use of DOF to eliminate bg distractions.  Well focused yet you held back on sharpening (it''s just right) and didn''t lose the softness of the fur.  Nicely done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'First thought was aaawwwww.  :D  I had a Shelty years ago.  Lots and lots of brushing required.  He-he.  Looks like you''re doing a fine job of keeping him/her groomed and it pays off here.  I hope this gets the attention it deserves as you''ve illustrated wind at work (in two ways) in a wonderful image.  Nice use of DOF to eliminate bg distractions.  Well focused yet you held back on sharpening (it''s just right) and didn''t lose the softness of the fur.  Nicely done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978324, 418842, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful shot - just feels so contrived for this challenge.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful shot - just feels so contrived for this challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978334, 419117, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, you certainly can tell it was a windy day.  :D  While it''s a nice photo it doesn''t jump out and say "look at me".  The pier/dock adds a bit of clutter, however it does add context (which is good).  Seems that maybe it was a little underexposed and you pushed it up some to bring out the foreground.  In doing so the whites in the clouds have blown out.  The photo is also quite cold with the heavy blue cast.  That may have been your intent, but I think it could stand to be warmed up a little by adjusting the color temperature to a warmer tone.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, you certainly can tell it was a windy day.  :D  While it''s a nice photo it doesn''t jump out and say "look at me".  The pier/dock adds a bit of clutter, however it does add context (which is good).  Seems that maybe it was a little underexposed and you pushed it up some to bring out the foreground.  In doing so the whites in the clouds have blown out.  The photo is also quite cold with the heavy blue cast.  That may have been your intent, but I think it could stand to be warmed up a little by adjusting the color temperature to a warmer tone.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978344, 417172, 67152, '<td valign="top">The best of the flag photos in the challenge.</td>', 'The best of the flag photos in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978354, 419050, 67578, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2006-10-31 09:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
