(2978393, 419006, 67578, '<td valign="top">i like it</td>', 'i like it', '2006-10-31 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978395, 418986, 30049, '<td valign="top">If the tops of those flag poles weren''t blurry this would come across a little stronger.  I guess the whole pole could be moving.  Hmmm, hadn''t considered that.  Unfortunately, the first reaction is that it''s blurry and many viewers aren''t going to slow down enough to try and see what is happening here (it''s VERY windy).  Did you do something to alter the sky color in post-processing?  Haven''t seen that hue before in a natural condition.  Hope you were bundled up - it looks COLD!  :D  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'If the tops of those flag poles weren''t blurry this would come across a little stronger.  I guess the whole pole could be moving.  Hmmm, hadn''t considered that.  Unfortunately, the first reaction is that it''s blurry and many viewers aren''t going to slow down enough to try and see what is happening here (it''s VERY windy).  Did you do something to alter the sky color in post-processing?  Haven''t seen that hue before in a natural condition.  Hope you were bundled up - it looks COLD!  :D  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
