(2978403, 417924, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Ok.  There WAS some wind here at one point maybe.  I think some action or motion to indicate wind at the time of capturing the photo is going to go a little farther in scoring higher with viewers/voters in this challenge.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Ok.  There WAS some wind here at one point maybe.  I think some action or motion to indicate wind at the time of capturing the photo is going to go a little farther in scoring higher with viewers/voters in this challenge.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2006-10-31 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978408, 418184, 30049, '<td valign="top">Funny exaggerated POV here.  :D  Certainly is some wind going on to blow that mane around like that.</td>', 'Funny exaggerated POV here.  :D  Certainly is some wind going on to blow that mane around like that.', '2006-10-31 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978414, 419299, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has HDR written all over it.  The clouds look 3D and overexposed in a few spots.  Cool capturing the blowing sand and whitecap waves.  The sand is the coolest part of this photo for me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has HDR written all over it.  The clouds look 3D and overexposed in a few spots.  Cool capturing the blowing sand and whitecap waves.  The sand is the coolest part of this photo for me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 10:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978421, 419323, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a shot I had considered trying but didn''t have the time or patience to pursue.  The concept is great, but IMO the execution is a tad bit short on this difficult shot.  From the thumbnail I was thinking "oh WOW!" but at full size the leaf is too blurred to really take this image to the top in this challenge.  Dang.  So close.</td>', 'This is a shot I had considered trying but didn''t have the time or patience to pursue.  The concept is great, but IMO the execution is a tad bit short on this difficult shot.  From the thumbnail I was thinking "oh WOW!" but at full size the leaf is too blurred to really take this image to the top in this challenge.  Dang.  So close.', '2006-10-31 10:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978429, 419395, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sculptural effect those windmills have.  The slope of the land and tint you used all make this a very pleasant image. 9.</td>', 'Lovely sculptural effect those windmills have.  The slope of the land and tint you used all make this a very pleasant image. 9.', '2006-10-31 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978433, 419387, 51538, '<td valign="top">Outstanding for your photo''s drama and actors.  The b/w rendition works very well. 9.</td>', 'Outstanding for your photo''s drama and actors.  The b/w rendition works very well. 9.', '2006-10-31 10:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978438, 419275, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene and the two characters are in just the right stance.  Kites are not so cooperative when it comes to photographing them.  But you did a good job.  My only criticism is that the photo appears noisy or has artifacts.  Perhaps that''s because you boosted the hues.  The sky looks a little odd with the circular spot trails.  I wonder if that is cloning? 7.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene and the two characters are in just the right stance.  Kites are not so cooperative when it comes to photographing them.  But you did a good job.  My only criticism is that the photo appears noisy or has artifacts.  Perhaps that''s because you boosted the hues.  The sky looks a little odd with the circular spot trails.  I wonder if that is cloning? 7.', '2006-10-31 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978440, 419299, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yours is a grand view of a genuinely windy day at the beach.  The colours and contrast make this outstanding, IMO. 9.</td>', 'Yours is a grand view of a genuinely windy day at the beach.  The colours and contrast make this outstanding, IMO. 9.', '2006-10-31 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
