(2978446, 418793, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the tint very much and the small pier peeking out from behind the tree is a nice touch.  The wind-swept tree really says it all. 9.</td>', 'I like the tint very much and the small pier peeking out from behind the tree is a nice touch.  The wind-swept tree really says it all. 9.', '2006-10-31 10:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
