(2978956, 417831, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks similar in location to the ''Oxymoron'' shoot if I have my photographer straight.  :)  This entry here is fine overall.  Nothing earth shaking.  I think the main subject is not a large enough piece of the composition, and the theme of wind doesn''t come to the forefront as it should.  JMO of course.  As a B/W the post-processing looks fine with nice contrast and range coverage.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks similar in location to the ''Oxymoron'' shoot if I have my photographer straight.  :)  This entry here is fine overall.  Nothing earth shaking.  I think the main subject is not a large enough piece of the composition, and the theme of wind doesn''t come to the forefront as it should.  JMO of course.  As a B/W the post-processing looks fine with nice contrast and range coverage.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978985, 419331, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit title driven to me.  If you just look at this photo the challenge theme of wind wouldn''t be a main subject.  It IS a very nice image to look at.  Good luck.</td>', 'Seems a bit title driven to me.  If you just look at this photo the challenge theme of wind wouldn''t be a main subject.  It IS a very nice image to look at.  Good luck.', '2006-10-31 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
