(2978996, 417819, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve put this together with your composition/framing of the subject.  Can''t argue there''s no wind in this one!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve put this together with your composition/framing of the subject.  Can''t argue there''s no wind in this one!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 15:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2979006, 418669, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this.  I am having a hard time getting "comfortable" in viewing this as I''m not sure where to rest my eyes and focus.  Sailboat, bridge, sailboat, bridge...  :D  Something feels a little hazy and muted, almost like there was some heavy glare to cut thru.  I''d say more contrast would cut it down some, but the contrast looks pretty good now.  Oh well, just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Overall I like this.  I am having a hard time getting "comfortable" in viewing this as I''m not sure where to rest my eyes and focus.  Sailboat, bridge, sailboat, bridge...  :D  Something feels a little hazy and muted, almost like there was some heavy glare to cut thru.  I''d say more contrast would cut it down some, but the contrast looks pretty good now.  Oh well, just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-31 15:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2979010, 417768, 62318, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo in the challenge, and one of the most visually striking in a while. The amount of movement is perfect and makes the ordinary very enthralling. The side lighting was a very nice touch. Curious on how long it took to prepare the shot. A rare 10.</td>', 'My favorite photo in the challenge, and one of the most visually striking in a while. The amount of movement is perfect and makes the ordinary very enthralling. The side lighting was a very nice touch. Curious on how long it took to prepare the shot. A rare 10.', '2006-10-31 15:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
