(2980400, 419299, 14476, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFULLY done.  Yes, I just shouted (and I''m glad).  This is a perfect example of the Challenge.  And I''m so pleased you entered it.  Hope it makes the front page.  I''ll do my part.  10</td>', 'BEAUTIFULLY done.  Yes, I just shouted (and I''m glad).  This is a perfect example of the Challenge.  And I''m so pleased you entered it.  Hope it makes the front page.  I''ll do my part.  10', '2006-10-31 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980401, 417320, 14476, '<td valign="top">The imagination required to find this delightful <br/>image also requires a 10 from this viewer.</td>', 'The imagination required to find this delightful image also requires a 10 from this viewer.', '2006-10-31 22:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980402, 417768, 14476, '<td valign="top">Just perfect abstract.  Really, really good.<br/>Wish it was mine.</td>', 'Just perfect abstract.  Really, really good.Wish it was mine.', '2006-10-31 22:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980403, 418803, 30982, '<td valign="top">Waves, though primarily tidal and shoreline related, are enhanced by wind so I do see it as meeting the challenge.  The bird adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Waves, though primarily tidal and shoreline related, are enhanced by wind so I do see it as meeting the challenge.  The bird adds a nice touch.', '2006-10-31 22:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980405, 418341, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most entertaining capture speaking of man against the wind! Bump.</td>', 'A most entertaining capture speaking of man against the wind! Bump.', '2006-10-31 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980407, 419367, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awwww.  You got out there and took advantage of our beautiful weather during the past few days.  This is just gorgeous.  Excellent colors, composition, and all the rest.  And those sails were just barely filled by the miniscule wind we have had with the warmth.  I''ll look forward to knowing who this is after the challenge.</td>', 'Awwww.  You got out there and took advantage of our beautiful weather during the past few days.  This is just gorgeous.  Excellent colors, composition, and all the rest.  And those sails were just barely filled by the miniscule wind we have had with the warmth.  I''ll look forward to knowing who this is after the challenge.', '2006-10-31 22:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980409, 417899, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with massive feel. Bump.</td>', 'Nice capture with massive feel. Bump.', '2006-10-31 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980410, 417867, 64928, '<td valign="top">There are some nice elements in this picture.  I like the water droplets and the silhouette  water fountain, but there are too many distractions for a top-notch photo.</td>', 'There are some nice elements in this picture.  I like the water droplets and the silhouette  water fountain, but there are too many distractions for a top-notch photo.', '2006-10-31 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980412, 419206, 30982, '<td valign="top">I doubt it was 180 mph - leafblower, maybe.  :-)  Good motion capture of the leaves, but needs a little more in content/context as a standalone photo, in my opinion.</td>', 'I doubt it was 180 mph - leafblower, maybe.  :-)  Good motion capture of the leaves, but needs a little more in content/context as a standalone photo, in my opinion.', '2006-10-31 22:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980413, 419299, 64928, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-10-31 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980416, 418452, 22734, '<td valign="top">A bump for the north Wind.</td>', 'A bump for the north Wind.', '2006-10-31 22:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980419, 418962, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture with that melting feel. Bump.</td>', 'Lovely capture with that melting feel. Bump.', '2006-10-31 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980422, 417320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic image - I like the way the sand lines echo and extend the windblown hair.  A touch of levels and contrast really brings out the design in the sand a bit more, too.  Good interpretation of the challenge!</td>', 'Nice graphic image - I like the way the sand lines echo and extend the windblown hair.  A touch of levels and contrast really brings out the design in the sand a bit more, too.  Good interpretation of the challenge!', '2006-10-31 22:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980423, 418417, 64928, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo; good focus, just enough blur where the hair is blowing,good bokeh.</td>', 'I really like this photo; good focus, just enough blur where the hair is blowing,good bokeh.', '2006-10-31 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980424, 417581, 22734, '<td valign="top">Placid colors and a lovely composition. Bump.</td>', 'Placid colors and a lovely composition. Bump.', '2006-10-31 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980430, 419299, 22734, '<td valign="top">Eerie rendition. Bump.</td>', 'Eerie rendition. Bump.', '2006-10-31 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980431, 418962, 64928, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection</td>', 'Interesting reflection', '2006-10-31 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980433, 418891, 22734, '<td valign="top">Mournful, wrenching and so cold...Bump.</td>', 'Mournful, wrenching and so cold...Bump.', '2006-10-31 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980435, 419361, 30982, '<td valign="top">Windtunnel?  If not the real thing, it''s pretty convincing.</td>', 'Windtunnel?  If not the real thing, it''s pretty convincing.', '2006-10-31 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980438, 417041, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool editing, nice job with the reds and the sign is a nice touch!  Love the location.</td>', 'Cool editing, nice job with the reds and the sign is a nice touch!  Love the location.', '2006-10-31 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980439, 417900, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is so funny and wonderful entry. Bump.</td>', 'This is so funny and wonderful entry. Bump.', '2006-10-31 23:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980442, 419107, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2006-10-31 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980443, 419194, 22734, '<td valign="top">Flames appear like a scarf in the wind! Bump.</td>', 'Flames appear like a scarf in the wind! Bump.', '2006-10-31 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980445, 417692, 22734, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! Bump.</td>', 'Excellent capture! Bump.', '2006-10-31 23:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980446, 418842, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of both light and wind.  Gorgeous model.</td>', 'Nice use of both light and wind.  Gorgeous model.', '2006-10-31 23:02:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2980452, 418752, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a fun picture!  Great backdrop, convincing on the windy part.</td>', 'What a fun picture!  Great backdrop, convincing on the windy part.', '2006-10-31 23:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980456, 419119, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ll undoubtedly get dinged for the "not level" horizon.  This shot is more about the moonlight to me than the wind, but I shan''t ding you for that too badly.</td>', 'You''ll undoubtedly get dinged for the "not level" horizon.  This shot is more about the moonlight to me than the wind, but I shan''t ding you for that too badly.', '2006-10-31 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980459, 418184, 22734, '<td valign="top">Love the expression! Bump.</td>', 'Love the expression! Bump.', '2006-10-31 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980463, 419121, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Lovely study, even with the chainlink fence in there.  Nice detail on the seed thing.</td>', 'Nice!  Lovely study, even with the chainlink fence in there.  Nice detail on the seed thing.', '2006-10-31 23:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980470, 419225, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of the flags to depict the wind.  Overall focus is a little soft but not in a displeasing way.  A touch more sharpening crisps it up a bit, though.</td>', 'Good use of the flags to depict the wind.  Overall focus is a little soft but not in a displeasing way.  A touch more sharpening crisps it up a bit, though.', '2006-10-31 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980472, 419358, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now here''s sailing where the wind is definitely depicted nicely.</td>', 'Now here''s sailing where the wind is definitely depicted nicely.', '2006-10-31 23:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980476, 418443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good job on the exposure and a very subtle depiction of the challenge topic.</td>', 'Nice!  Good job on the exposure and a very subtle depiction of the challenge topic.', '2006-10-31 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980484, 417077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed with the curve of the grasses.</td>', 'Nicely composed with the curve of the grasses.', '2006-10-31 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980487, 418152, 30982, '<td valign="top">The first snow mound looks kinda like a giant white bear hugging the bush and the little trees in the back look like a family of some kind.  Really quite an interesting picture to me.</td>', 'The first snow mound looks kinda like a giant white bear hugging the bush and the little trees in the back look like a family of some kind.  Really quite an interesting picture to me.', '2006-10-31 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980489, 419329, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant color on the chute and the flag - nicely captured.</td>', 'Great vibrant color on the chute and the flag - nicely captured.', '2006-10-31 23:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980490, 418571, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute shot (though a bit cheesy) and pretty well executed.</td>', 'Cute shot (though a bit cheesy) and pretty well executed.', '2006-10-31 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980495, 418283, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice processing - I like the overlapping of the stripes.</td>', 'Nice processing - I like the overlapping of the stripes.', '2006-10-31 23:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980499, 419393, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the challenge.  I suspect most won''t see "wind" here, but I like impression this creates of "wind", whether it be present or not.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the challenge.  I suspect most won''t see "wind" here, but I like impression this creates of "wind", whether it be present or not.  Very nicely done.', '2006-10-31 23:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980508, 418574, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice capture.  Though it seems a little oversaturated, I like the way it turned out.  The colors of the waves are quite nice, and the birds all facing the same direction, even in flight, depict "wind" to me.</td>', 'Quite a nice capture.  Though it seems a little oversaturated, I like the way it turned out.  The colors of the waves are quite nice, and the birds all facing the same direction, even in flight, depict "wind" to me.', '2006-10-31 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980541, 418786, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF to isolate this gem from it''s bigger neighbors.  Wind is implied to me though not visibly present.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF to isolate this gem from it''s bigger neighbors.  Wind is implied to me though not visibly present.', '2006-10-31 23:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980544, 418452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Combination of a sailing vessel and the flags works to convey the challenge topic.  Fairly good composition - now you just need to have someone remove that building that looks out of place.  :-)</td>', 'Combination of a sailing vessel and the flags works to convey the challenge topic.  Fairly good composition - now you just need to have someone remove that building that looks out of place.  :-)', '2006-10-31 23:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980547, 416768, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, yes, but is otherwise kind of bland as a standalone picture (unless an ad for Ontario Power, inc which case you''ll want to brighten it up a bit.)</td>', 'Meets the challenge, yes, but is otherwise kind of bland as a standalone picture (unless an ad for Ontario Power, inc which case you''ll want to brighten it up a bit.)', '2006-10-31 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980551, 417819, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite vivid color!  Definitely satisfies the challenge.</td>', 'Quite vivid color!  Definitely satisfies the challenge.', '2006-10-31 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980553, 418770, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and a lovely sky to show off the flag.</td>', 'Very nice light and a lovely sky to show off the flag.', '2006-10-31 23:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980554, 418621, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gentle and subtle.  Nice light, too.</td>', 'Gentle and subtle.  Nice light, too.', '2006-10-31 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980556, 418286, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how this has two halves with the upper being primarily green though with a touch of color, and vice versa for the lower.</td>', 'I like how this has two halves with the upper being primarily green though with a touch of color, and vice versa for the lower.', '2006-10-31 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980585, 418521, 66253, '<td valign="top">Wow, powerful! I like the lighting and the birds.</td>', 'Wow, powerful! I like the lighting and the birds.', '2006-10-31 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980632, 418152, 60862, '<td valign="top">Blurry and the color seems pretty blue.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'Blurry and the color seems pretty blue.  Nice idea, though.', '2006-10-31 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980634, 419155, 60862, '<td valign="top">Blurry and not related to wind as far as I can tell.</td>', 'Blurry and not related to wind as far as I can tell.', '2006-10-31 23:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980638, 419318, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture, but to me it shows a lack of wind since the smoke''s going straight up.</td>', 'This is a cool picture, but to me it shows a lack of wind since the smoke''s going straight up.', '2006-10-31 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980639, 417827, 60862, '<td valign="top">This seems to show a calm day.  Some motion blur on the windmills would''ve been better suited to this challenge.  That said, I like the composition.</td>', 'This seems to show a calm day.  Some motion blur on the windmills would''ve been better suited to this challenge.  That said, I like the composition.', '2006-10-31 23:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980641, 419327, 63398, '<td valign="top">Question is.....was that wind or water that did the sculpting?</td>', 'Question is.....was that wind or water that did the sculpting?', '2006-10-31 23:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980642, 417867, 60862, '<td valign="top">The water seems to be falling straight down, showing calm, not wind.</td>', 'The water seems to be falling straight down, showing calm, not wind.', '2006-10-31 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980649, 418842, 60862, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be stunned.</td>', 'If this doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be stunned.', '2006-10-31 23:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980650, 419339, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great Capture!</td>', 'Great Capture!', '2006-10-31 23:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2980651, 419339, 52449, '<td valign="top">The expression is very unique--I like it.</td>', 'The expression is very unique--I like it.', '2006-10-31 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981090, 419019, 36619, '<td valign="top">wow! great detail. love the ruffled feathers</td>', 'wow! great detail. love the ruffled feathers', '2006-11-01 00:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
