(2982405, 417899, 29748, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats neat.  Its a little brave to be standing out in that storm.</td>', 'Wow, thats neat.  Its a little brave to be standing out in that storm.', '2006-11-01 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
