(2982747, 419141, 29949, '<td valign="top">BRILLIANT PHOTO!!! <br/>I LOVE IT!! wooooow !! I think this is no.1 GREAT shot in this challege for me !</td>', 'BRILLIANT PHOTO!!! I LOVE IT!! wooooow !! I think this is no.1 GREAT shot in this challege for me !', '2006-11-01 09:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982782, 418623, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some brilliant color here.  Wow!  Very good details in the water and reflections on the sand.  For some reason the main rocks seem a little soft/fuzzy around the edges.  Good choice in selecting the scarf to use as it ties into the color scheme quite nicely.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Some brilliant color here.  Wow!  Very good details in the water and reflections on the sand.  For some reason the main rocks seem a little soft/fuzzy around the edges.  Good choice in selecting the scarf to use as it ties into the color scheme quite nicely.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982802, 418468, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking clouds.  Thin connection to the challenge theme IMO.  Myself, I''m looking for wind that is more tangible and can be felt physically.  If the image makes me feel like I can almost feel the wind then it has a strong connection.  JMO of course.  Interesting photo and well captured overall considering the tricky exposure and lighting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool looking clouds.  Thin connection to the challenge theme IMO.  Myself, I''m looking for wind that is more tangible and can be felt physically.  If the image makes me feel like I can almost feel the wind then it has a strong connection.  JMO of course.  Interesting photo and well captured overall considering the tricky exposure and lighting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982821, 418160, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image as far as seascape/landscapes go.  Evidence of wind is thin.  I''m thinking the connection is the waves coming ashore?  It works in a minimalistic approach I guess.  Again, a very nice photograph you''ve captured here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image as far as seascape/landscapes go.  Evidence of wind is thin.  I''m thinking the connection is the waves coming ashore?  It works in a minimalistic approach I guess.  Again, a very nice photograph you''ve captured here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982827, 419388, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Quite the breeze working there I see.  :D  Good luck!</td>', 'Ok.  Quite the breeze working there I see.  :D  Good luck!', '2006-11-01 09:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982843, 418472, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok", a little ho-hummish IMO.  Nothing personal, just isn''t jumping out and making an artistic statement.  Feels rather documentary.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s "ok", a little ho-hummish IMO.  Nothing personal, just isn''t jumping out and making an artistic statement.  Feels rather documentary.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982859, 419367, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic shot.  Certainly indicates wind is present.  Too bad you couldn''t get a more interesting sky to cooperate the day of your shot.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice scenic shot.  Certainly indicates wind is present.  Too bad you couldn''t get a more interesting sky to cooperate the day of your shot.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982880, 418417, 15358, '<td valign="top">I like the profile and focus of your shot</td>', 'I like the profile and focus of your shot', '2006-11-01 09:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982886, 417191, 15358, '<td valign="top">That snow piled up fast with the size of the flakes,  nice capture</td>', 'That snow piled up fast with the size of the flakes,  nice capture', '2006-11-01 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982910, 418753, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured wind at work.  That part is cool.  Not really a big fan of the fake looking IR stuff.  Putting that aside, the sky is quite grainy.  The curved road line adds a nice element to this shot and the light pole front left also helps to direct the viewer.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured wind at work.  That part is cool.  Not really a big fan of the fake looking IR stuff.  Putting that aside, the sky is quite grainy.  The curved road line adds a nice element to this shot and the light pole front left also helps to direct the viewer.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 09:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982920, 418842, 15358, '<td valign="top">your main light could have been turned down just a little, excellent otherwise.</td>', 'your main light could have been turned down just a little, excellent otherwise.', '2006-11-01 09:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982932, 419391, 15358, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the compostion,  the focus just brings the image down</td>', 'I like the colors and the compostion,  the focus just brings the image down', '2006-11-01 09:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982954, 419300, 15358, '<td valign="top">could this have been composed with out the sky?</td>', 'could this have been composed with out the sky?', '2006-11-01 09:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982958, 419275, 15358, '<td valign="top">the look of the clouds detracts from the image</td>', 'the look of the clouds detracts from the image', '2006-11-01 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982961, 418890, 15358, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2006-11-01 09:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982968, 418244, 15358, '<td valign="top">sweet capture</td>', 'sweet capture', '2006-11-01 09:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983296, 419066, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of wind (and energy).  I can almost hear the noise that this group had to have been making.  :)  Looks like the technicals are in order.  The way the seagulls span the photo lends nice balance to this.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of wind (and energy).  I can almost hear the noise that this group had to have been making.  :)  Looks like the technicals are in order.  The way the seagulls span the photo lends nice balance to this.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983356, 418574, 42495, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks like you had some nasty wind that day.  I like the overall dreariness brought out by the colors.</td>', 'It certainly looks like you had some nasty wind that day.  I like the overall dreariness brought out by the colors.', '2006-11-01 10:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983408, 419254, 42495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and really nice bokeh.  Just the right amount of wind, any less and it wouldn''t be apparent, any more and it would be too much.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and really nice bokeh.  Just the right amount of wind, any less and it wouldn''t be apparent, any more and it would be too much.', '2006-11-01 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983476, 418907, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good job on the B&amp;W; lots of shade of gray and good contrast.</td>', 'Good job on the B&W; lots of shade of gray and good contrast.', '2006-11-01 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983505, 416531, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn plastic fences anyway!  :)  Just kidding about the fence.  You''ve done a nice job putting this composition together.  Some strong lines working to add interest and the main pieces are well balanced in contributing to the story (corn stalks, sky, fence/barn).  Feels gloomy, which is what you were going for.  Nice PP work to enhance that.  Just enough movement is some of the stalks to indicate a wind is indeed blowing.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Darn plastic fences anyway!  :)  Just kidding about the fence.  You''ve done a nice job putting this composition together.  Some strong lines working to add interest and the main pieces are well balanced in contributing to the story (corn stalks, sky, fence/barn).  Feels gloomy, which is what you were going for.  Nice PP work to enhance that.  Just enough movement is some of the stalks to indicate a wind is indeed blowing.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983536, 419087, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Ok.  Go Super Dog.  It''s cute, but I''m not really buying into the wind theme of this photo.  Sorry.  The image also seems a bit dark, like the dog could be brightened up a little.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep.  Ok.  Go Super Dog.  It''s cute, but I''m not really buying into the wind theme of this photo.  Sorry.  The image also seems a bit dark, like the dog could be brightened up a little.  Good luck.', '2006-11-01 11:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983570, 417348, 30049, '<td valign="top">The flag is well focused, and you have some other elements of interest to look at, which is good.  The foreground item just creeping into the photo (bottom center) is distracting.  The big distraction is that tilted horizon!  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'The flag is well focused, and you have some other elements of interest to look at, which is good.  The foreground item just creeping into the photo (bottom center) is distracting.  The big distraction is that tilted horizon!  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983593, 417415, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W photo that meets the challenge quite well.  The fun is infectious (her smile).  :D  May be a little overexposed in the clouds (left center), but you can get away with that a little with this PP treatment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice B/W photo that meets the challenge quite well.  The fun is infectious (her smile).  :D  May be a little overexposed in the clouds (left center), but you can get away with that a little with this PP treatment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983623, 418907, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground blur on the left.  Helps to take that out of the viewers way and lead to the person.  The brick lines also help out in that regard quite nicely.  You''ve done a nice job indicating wind and meeting the challenge theme.  B/W works well here, but I think the range is a bit short when it comes to blacks (could be deeper - or it may be this cruddy monitor).  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the foreground blur on the left.  Helps to take that out of the viewers way and lead to the person.  The brick lines also help out in that regard quite nicely.  You''ve done a nice job indicating wind and meeting the challenge theme.  B/W works well here, but I think the range is a bit short when it comes to blacks (could be deeper - or it may be this cruddy monitor).  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983936, 419121, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color, but where is the wind?  Oops, wait.  I do see some blur in the middle left grass (pod?).  May not be evident enough for people to grasp quickly.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Great detail and color, but where is the wind?  Oops, wait.  I do see some blur in the middle left grass (pod?).  May not be evident enough for people to grasp quickly.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 12:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983945, 419332, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now there''s an interesting flagpole.  Image is very crisp and well focused. I would have taken a bit more off the top to improve the framing. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Now there''s an interesting flagpole.  Image is very crisp and well focused. I would have taken a bit more off the top to improve the framing. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983949, 419293, 30049, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like an abstract.  Good job of showing wind in your photo.  Couple of things that may be holding this back.  1) Little bit overexposed on the highlights.  2) The back wall is distracting - crop down a little and check it out.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Almost looks like an abstract.  Good job of showing wind in your photo.  Couple of things that may be holding this back.  1) Little bit overexposed on the highlights.  2) The back wall is distracting - crop down a little and check it out.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983955, 417900, 30049, '<td valign="top">So that''s what a widget looks like?  :D  Certainly is windy enough - you''ve got that covered.  A couple of things might be holding this down some; 1) it''s a little blurry - not quite sharp and well focused enough, 2) needs a little more contrast - as is, it''s coming across somewhat flat.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'So that''s what a widget looks like?  :D  Certainly is windy enough - you''ve got that covered.  A couple of things might be holding this down some; 1) it''s a little blurry - not quite sharp and well focused enough, 2) needs a little more contrast - as is, it''s coming across somewhat flat.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 12:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984416, 417172, 32338, '<td valign="top">I like it, bold and showing wind.  But something in me, perhaps the American, is a bit unsettled by the orientation.  (I think I''d like it more with mirror-image or flip processing.)</td>', 'I like it, bold and showing wind.  But something in me, perhaps the American, is a bit unsettled by the orientation.  (I think I''d like it more with mirror-image or flip processing.)', '2006-11-01 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984418, 419344, 32338, '<td valign="top">This is a bit humerous.</td>', 'This is a bit humerous.', '2006-11-01 13:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984465, 417899, 32338, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one of the reasons I like DP Challenge - an opportunity to see what I otherwise could not.  <br/>The magnitude of the waves and the wall are obvious with the people and lightpole as perspective.  The stormy colors feel stormy (rather than a WB problem) with the yellow stripe on the left-most persons clothing.  The placement of people and light pole is interesting, but I''m wondering if the photo would be stronger without the water at the bottom.</td>', 'Wow, this is one of the reasons I like DP Challenge - an opportunity to see what I otherwise could not.  The magnitude of the waves and the wall are obvious with the people and lightpole as perspective.  The stormy colors feel stormy (rather than a WB problem) with the yellow stripe on the left-most persons clothing.  The placement of people and light pole is interesting, but I''m wondering if the photo would be stronger without the water at the bottom.', '2006-11-01 13:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984471, 419017, 32338, '<td valign="top">Elegantly simple and cute.</td>', 'Elegantly simple and cute.', '2006-11-01 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984479, 419299, 32338, '<td valign="top">The post-processing gives this a menacing quality.</td>', 'The post-processing gives this a menacing quality.', '2006-11-01 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984484, 419181, 32338, '<td valign="top">Unique</td>', 'Unique', '2006-11-01 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984489, 419107, 32338, '<td valign="top">Exciting image</td>', 'Exciting image', '2006-11-01 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984496, 418468, 32338, '<td valign="top">Science photo?</td>', 'Science photo?', '2006-11-01 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984566, 418244, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze frame shot.  The bird is well exposed.  Hadn''t thought of this approach to visualizing wind, but it seems to work ok.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice freeze frame shot.  The bird is well exposed.  Hadn''t thought of this approach to visualizing wind, but it seems to work ok.  Good luck.', '2006-11-01 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984572, 418621, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the exposure and capturing the lighting on this.  Good choice of aperture selection for bg blur.  Wind is evident - which is a good thing.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice job on the exposure and capturing the lighting on this.  Good choice of aperture selection for bg blur.  Wind is evident - which is a good thing.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984582, 418452, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wee bit subtle (connection to challenge theme) I think.  Technically it fits, it''s just not "in your face". Tricky getting all of those angled lines to resize correctly without jaggies.  Exposure and clarity of this photo came out nice.  A polarizing filter would give you a richer blue in the sky.  The shot to get here (need a large zoom though) is that vertical flagpole and the multiple colored flags flying on the distant ship.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a wee bit subtle (connection to challenge theme) I think.  Technically it fits, it''s just not "in your face". Tricky getting all of those angled lines to resize correctly without jaggies.  Exposure and clarity of this photo came out nice.  A polarizing filter would give you a richer blue in the sky.  The shot to get here (need a large zoom though) is that vertical flagpole and the multiple colored flags flying on the distant ship.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 13:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984661, 418891, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Certainly windy in this photo.  Can''t help but wonder what the person is doing out in that weather in a cemetary.  Hopefully this isn''t disrespectful, but it looks like a photographer "chimping" his last shot.  :D  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.  Stay WARM!</td>', 'Yep.  Certainly windy in this photo.  Can''t help but wonder what the person is doing out in that weather in a cemetary.  Hopefully this isn''t disrespectful, but it looks like a photographer "chimping" his last shot.  :D  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.  Stay WARM!', '2006-11-01 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984674, 418446, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very abstract looking.  Including the tree gives it some context, otherwise it would difficult to know what you''re looking at.  While this is interesting, I''m not really sure that it gives the viewer (at least for me) a good sense of wind.  It''s not really a tangible item here.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very abstract looking.  Including the tree gives it some context, otherwise it would difficult to know what you''re looking at.  While this is interesting, I''m not really sure that it gives the viewer (at least for me) a good sense of wind.  It''s not really a tangible item here.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984729, 418795, 23203, '<td valign="top">This would be my pick for a ribbon. <br/>Great composition and processing. (goodman?)</td>', 'This would be my pick for a ribbon. Great composition and processing. (goodman?)', '2006-11-01 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984765, 418815, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting seeing leaves, that the mind knows are in color, in B/W.  I can understand your decision (eliminate bg or blown sky) and it works quite well.  Your photo is sharp, well focused, and is amazingly deep (focus goes all the to the parking lot).  Not sure if this was contrived or not, don''t really care, it''s a nicely done image.  Kudos!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting seeing leaves, that the mind knows are in color, in B/W.  I can understand your decision (eliminate bg or blown sky) and it works quite well.  Your photo is sharp, well focused, and is amazingly deep (focus goes all the to the parking lot).  Not sure if this was contrived or not, don''t really care, it''s a nicely done image.  Kudos!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984777, 418198, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not here''s an interesting take on the challenge.  Nice timing on the shutter release.  Will be interested in reading your comments on this when the challenge is finished for some details.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not here''s an interesting take on the challenge.  Nice timing on the shutter release.  Will be interested in reading your comments on this when the challenge is finished for some details.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984790, 418961, 30049, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, maybe a smidgen overexposed on the flagpole.  The flag is well focused and vivid.  Polarizer?  May have added a little more pop to the sky, although it''s pretty good as is.  One of the better flag entries I''ve seen so far.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Crisp, clear, maybe a smidgen overexposed on the flagpole.  The flag is well focused and vivid.  Polarizer?  May have added a little more pop to the sky, although it''s pretty good as is.  One of the better flag entries I''ve seen so far.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 14:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984805, 419362, 30049, '<td valign="top">Brrr.  That water just LOOKS cold!  Good capture of this moody setting (sky primarily).  The subject makes you think for a minute, which is good.  Wind is certainly evident in the water and the cape blowing around.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Brrr.  That water just LOOKS cold!  Good capture of this moody setting (sky primarily).  The subject makes you think for a minute, which is good.  Wind is certainly evident in the water and the cape blowing around.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.', '2006-11-01 14:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984835, 417827, 30049, '<td valign="top">I know those are wind machines but where is the wind?  It would be helpful to show some movement to sell the wind theme IMO.  This photo also seems a little underexposed.  Did you bump the levels or adjust the histogram any to see what impact it made?  Not really sure that the grassy hill is adding much to this, unless it''s blocking something in the distance that is not visually appealing.  I see more wind machines off to the back right that makes me curious for more.  All JMO of course. :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know those are wind machines but where is the wind?  It would be helpful to show some movement to sell the wind theme IMO.  This photo also seems a little underexposed.  Did you bump the levels or adjust the histogram any to see what impact it made?  Not really sure that the grassy hill is adding much to this, unless it''s blocking something in the distance that is not visually appealing.  I see more wind machines off to the back right that makes me curious for more.  All JMO of course. :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 14:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984885, 417172, 4536, '<td valign="top">Flipping the image would make it look more natural, nice colors but I have seen this so many times.</td>', 'Flipping the image would make it look more natural, nice colors but I have seen this so many times.', '2006-11-01 15:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984913, 419087, 4536, '<td valign="top">The only one that made me laugh, thanks!</td>', 'The only one that made me laugh, thanks!', '2006-11-01 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984954, 418842, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent job! High Score!</td>', 'Excellent job! High Score!', '2006-11-01 15:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985185, 417041, 56797, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!</td>', 'Amazing shot!', '2006-11-01 15:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985398, 418347, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this for it''s simplicity.  The image itself is busy (bg trees, etc...).  You''ve shown wind at work and connected to the challenge theme.  The angle of the branch you''ve selected adds some nice interest with the diagonal lines.  All of the above said, I''m not sure that your image has enough pop (WOW factor) to really move people to vote it much higher that 5-5.3.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this for it''s simplicity.  The image itself is busy (bg trees, etc...).  You''ve shown wind at work and connected to the challenge theme.  The angle of the branch you''ve selected adds some nice interest with the diagonal lines.  All of the above said, I''m not sure that your image has enough pop (WOW factor) to really move people to vote it much higher that 5-5.3.  JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 16:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985428, 419303, 42495, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and I''m curious as to how you pulled it off.  Good choice of red and green.</td>', 'Clever idea and I''m curious as to how you pulled it off.  Good choice of red and green.', '2006-11-01 16:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985798, 415901, 12733, '<td valign="top">Those white halos give an impression of one picture placed out of register over another. I don''t know what causes it, but it spoils the effect.</td>', 'Those white halos give an impression of one picture placed out of register over another. I don''t know what causes it, but it spoils the effect.', '2006-11-01 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985802, 418443, 12733, '<td valign="top">The candle on the face makes for an interesting lighting effect.</td>', 'The candle on the face makes for an interesting lighting effect.', '2006-11-01 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985807, 419124, 50982, '<td valign="top">Would have found this more appealing with her right arm down and the blowing scarves behind her, or more turned towards the camera. While this is about the wind, the subject should still be seen.<br/>Composition could have had her turned towards the camera but in the same spot or more to the left with the scarves falling in the left upper and lower quadrants.</td>', 'Would have found this more appealing with her right arm down and the blowing scarves behind her, or more turned towards the camera. While this is about the wind, the subject should still be seen.Composition could have had her turned towards the camera but in the same spot or more to the left with the scarves falling in the left upper and lower quadrants.', '2006-11-01 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985812, 416768, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, tight view.</td>', 'Nice, tight view.', '2006-11-01 17:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985818, 417900, 12733, '<td valign="top">Widget??? Very cute shot.</td>', 'Widget??? Very cute shot.', '2006-11-01 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
