(2985882, 419050, 45790, '<td valign="top">A very appealing abstract!</td>', 'A very appealing abstract!', '2006-11-01 17:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985885, 418521, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. It looks like a painting!</td>', 'Great lighting. It looks like a painting!', '2006-11-01 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985927, 419258, 60480, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2006-11-01 18:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985932, 416199, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract effect here.  I''m not too sure it has a "wind" feel, yet the motion and rhythm is nice. 5</td>', 'I love the abstract effect here.  I''m not too sure it has a "wind" feel, yet the motion and rhythm is nice. 5', '2006-11-01 18:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985978, 418152, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve shown the windblown snow piled into the brush, but the overall composition and interest of the image is average.</td>', 'You''ve shown the windblown snow piled into the brush, but the overall composition and interest of the image is average.', '2006-11-01 18:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985987, 419367, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition of the triangles.</td>', 'Nice repetition of the triangles.', '2006-11-01 18:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985990, 418871, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful snowdrifts and fence.  The shot is interesting, yet feels as thought the focus is set too far back into the left corner.  Still nice. 6</td>', 'Beautiful snowdrifts and fence.  The shot is interesting, yet feels as thought the focus is set too far back into the left corner.  Still nice. 6', '2006-11-01 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985995, 418347, 25218, '<td valign="top">This definitely shows wind, but there isn''t a focal point for the eyes to settle on. Nice depth of field, too.</td>', 'This definitely shows wind, but there isn''t a focal point for the eyes to settle on. Nice depth of field, too.', '2006-11-01 18:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986001, 417381, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very nightmarish, but I''m not clear on the wind connection.</td>', 'Very nightmarish, but I''m not clear on the wind connection.', '2006-11-01 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986006, 418679, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2006-11-01 18:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986010, 418375, 39429, '<td valign="top">Creative take on this idea.  The skin tones need to be more even and the application of the lipstick on the top of the lips, more accurate to really set it apart.  Still, nice take.  6</td>', 'Creative take on this idea.  The skin tones need to be more even and the application of the lipstick on the top of the lips, more accurate to really set it apart.  Still, nice take.  6', '2006-11-01 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986013, 418577, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice natural colors. I think a little less foreground would improve the composition and still get the "wind point" across. Also....the shore line should be straightened to horizontal.  A beauty of a scene.</td>', 'Nice natural colors. I think a little less foreground would improve the composition and still get the "wind point" across. Also....the shore line should be straightened to horizontal.  A beauty of a scene.', '2006-11-01 18:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986014, 418795, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expression, lighting and composition.  The shirt is a bit distracting, but the overall shot is absolutely charming. 8</td>', 'Beautiful expression, lighting and composition.  The shirt is a bit distracting, but the overall shot is absolutely charming. 8', '2006-11-01 18:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986023, 419361, 39429, '<td valign="top">I feel that this is supposed to look life sized, but is a model.  The front lines of red light are nice and follow the hood.  The rest of the shot is average.5</td>', 'I feel that this is supposed to look life sized, but is a model.  The front lines of red light are nice and follow the hood.  The rest of the shot is average.5', '2006-11-01 18:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986030, 418499, 8367, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the shadow enhances the photograph. I think a landscape crop eliminating the shadow would be just as effective. Nice colors and exposure.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the shadow enhances the photograph. I think a landscape crop eliminating the shadow would be just as effective. Nice colors and exposure.', '2006-11-01 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986033, 417172, 25218, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting that you display the union in the upper right, instead of the left - isn''t that sign of distress or something? You''ve captured nice detail in the folds.</td>', 'It''s interesting that you display the union in the upper right, instead of the left - isn''t that sign of distress or something? You''ve captured nice detail in the folds.', '2006-11-01 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986040, 419249, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! It could use a little more contrast, perhaps, but it''s gorgeously composed.</td>', 'Wonderful! It could use a little more contrast, perhaps, but it''s gorgeously composed.', '2006-11-01 18:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986050, 418969, 25218, '<td valign="top">Lovely - adding to favorites.</td>', 'Lovely - adding to favorites.', '2006-11-01 18:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986056, 419120, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice natural colors. Very refreshing to see. I would imagine that this won''t score very well, though. Meets the challenge...but not very interesting.</td>', 'Nice natural colors. Very refreshing to see. I would imagine that this won''t score very well, though. Meets the challenge...but not very interesting.', '2006-11-01 18:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986089, 418753, 25218, '<td valign="top">These infrared shots just do not do it for me. That''s my problem, I know, but I really don''t see how infrared adds anything to this. Why did you make it infrared? Just because you could? I''m not trying berate or belittle you, I''m just at a point in my "photography" where I find myself, asking "Why?" more often, and I really am curious why you chose to use this treatment.<br/> <br/>You know, the more I look at this, the more it''s growing on me. I like the clarity of the strong, vertical pole contrasting with the blurry, moving trees, and the infrared seems to really emphasize that difference. I guess I should just think of infrared as a different kind of Blk &amp; Wht. Thanks!</td>', 'These infrared shots just do not do it for me. That''s my problem, I know, but I really don''t see how infrared adds anything to this. Why did you make it infrared? Just because you could? I''m not trying berate or belittle you, I''m just at a point in my "photography" where I find myself, asking "Why?" more often, and I really am curious why you chose to use this treatment. You know, the more I look at this, the more it''s growing on me. I like the clarity of the strong, vertical pole contrasting with the blurry, moving trees, and the infrared seems to really emphasize that difference. I guess I should just think of infrared as a different kind of Blk & Wht. Thanks!', '2006-11-01 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986093, 419299, 2158, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-11-01 18:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986094, 418815, 25218, '<td valign="top">I feel frustrated that I can''t see her face, but I really like this photo a lot. Very playful, well composed, &amp; nice tonal range. Thanks!</td>', 'I feel frustrated that I can''t see her face, but I really like this photo a lot. Very playful, well composed, & nice tonal range. Thanks!', '2006-11-01 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986133, 419303, 31829, '<td valign="top">Damn, got a fire extinguisher handy? LOL!</td>', 'Damn, got a fire extinguisher handy? LOL!', '2006-11-01 18:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986153, 418184, 60979, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. It looks like he''s desperately holding onto the grass to keep from being blown away.<br/> <br/>I don''t normally vote on horse pictures because I''m terribly afraid of the things, but this one is too cute to frighten me. 7.</td>', 'Hahaha. It looks like he''s desperately holding onto the grass to keep from being blown away. I don''t normally vote on horse pictures because I''m terribly afraid of the things, but this one is too cute to frighten me. 7.', '2006-11-01 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986300, 418417, 60698, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen my dogs put their nose to the wind like this. I love this shot. It''s perfect IMHO!!</td>', 'I''ve seen my dogs put their nose to the wind like this. I love this shot. It''s perfect IMHO!!', '2006-11-01 19:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986329, 419299, 60698, '<td valign="top">This really shows the wind and meets the challenge very well. That sand blowing around must have been hard on you and your equipment!!<br/> <br/>The sky seems a bit on green side, but I like the photo a lot because of all the puffy white clouds in the sky. The buildings add interest as does the bridge in the distance. Good work!</td>', 'This really shows the wind and meets the challenge very well. That sand blowing around must have been hard on you and your equipment!! The sky seems a bit on green side, but I like the photo a lot because of all the puffy white clouds in the sky. The buildings add interest as does the bridge in the distance. Good work!', '2006-11-01 19:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986355, 418966, 60698, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful moody type of image. Meets the challenge very well and the black and white choice is perfect. The house is a bit tilted, but I like it very much in this case. Sort of reminds me of the Wizard of Oz.</td>', 'This is a beautiful moody type of image. Meets the challenge very well and the black and white choice is perfect. The house is a bit tilted, but I like it very much in this case. Sort of reminds me of the Wizard of Oz.', '2006-11-01 19:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986389, 418795, 60698, '<td valign="top">Just lovely!</td>', 'Just lovely!', '2006-11-01 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986394, 418842, 60698, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Lighting, pose, compostions all fantastic. Meets challenge very well and you have a lovely model with classic beauty.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Lighting, pose, compostions all fantastic. Meets challenge very well and you have a lovely model with classic beauty.', '2006-11-01 20:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986406, 419249, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Composition and focus very nice!! Add to that the adorable cow looking back at the subject. Like to see the color version.</td>', 'Great shot! Composition and focus very nice!! Add to that the adorable cow looking back at the subject. Like to see the color version.', '2006-11-01 20:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986418, 418286, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice wind abstract.</td>', 'Nice wind abstract.', '2006-11-01 20:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986457, 417415, 60698, '<td valign="top">This seems to capture a genuine happy emotion. Black and white is a great choice. Meets the challenge very well. Great photo!</td>', 'This seems to capture a genuine happy emotion. Black and white is a great choice. Meets the challenge very well. Great photo!', '2006-11-01 20:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986468, 419380, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!! Captures the meaning of the challenge and is very appealing.</td>', 'Wonderful photo!! Captures the meaning of the challenge and is very appealing.', '2006-11-01 20:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986504, 418452, 30605, '<td valign="top">The aliasing really kills this beautiful shot</td>', 'The aliasing really kills this beautiful shot', '2006-11-01 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986505, 418962, 64009, '<td valign="top">Nice eye !!</td>', 'Nice eye !!', '2006-11-01 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986507, 418630, 60698, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo but the looks on the girl''s face suggests that she is suffering or in pain. Maybe that was your intention.</td>', 'Lovely photo but the looks on the girl''s face suggests that she is suffering or in pain. Maybe that was your intention.', '2006-11-01 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986509, 418823, 64009, '<td valign="top">very nice composition with the frame...well done !!!</td>', 'very nice composition with the frame...well done !!!', '2006-11-01 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986516, 419299, 64009, '<td valign="top">cool !!</td>', 'cool !!', '2006-11-01 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986518, 419096, 60698, '<td valign="top">Like the gold of her dress repeated in the golden crops in the background.</td>', 'Like the gold of her dress repeated in the golden crops in the background.', '2006-11-01 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
