(2988769, 417831, 36619, '<td valign="top">lovely location and model. i like the black and white, but would also be interested in see-ing a color version. 9</td>', 'lovely location and model. i like the black and white, but would also be interested in see-ing a color version. 9', '2006-11-02 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988790, 417415, 62989, '<td valign="top">My only 10 in this challenge - love it</td>', 'My only 10 in this challenge - love it', '2006-11-02 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988831, 418966, 32968, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but I don''t care much for the crop. I would love to be able to see more of the shot. What I can see is gorgeous, the lighting creates such an eerie mood, and the black and white completes it. Everything but the composition works for me.</td>', 'Beautiful scene but I don''t care much for the crop. I would love to be able to see more of the shot. What I can see is gorgeous, the lighting creates such an eerie mood, and the black and white completes it. Everything but the composition works for me.', '2006-11-02 11:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988848, 418949, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for most of the photos in this challenge. Your is a different story. I like it a lot. I haven''t decided if I''m gonna vote yet but if I do, yours will get a 10. Update - I decided to vote. 10</td>', 'I don''t care for most of the photos in this challenge. Your is a different story. I like it a lot. I haven''t decided if I''m gonna vote yet but if I do, yours will get a 10. Update - I decided to vote. 10', '2006-11-02 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
