(2988879, 419319, 62187, '<td valign="top">The horizon looks level but the lighthouse doesn''t...I hate when that happens. I think an average of the two might have helped better (?) or lining up the vertical crop with the lighthouse instead. However, it''s a lovely shot and I still think it''s good for an 8.</td>', 'The horizon looks level but the lighthouse doesn''t...I hate when that happens. I think an average of the two might have helped better (?) or lining up the vertical crop with the lighthouse instead. However, it''s a lovely shot and I still think it''s good for an 8.', '2006-11-02 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988889, 418961, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope the voters are being kinder to you. I have a similar shot. I''m gonna score your photo higher then my current average...good luck to ya.</td>', 'I hope the voters are being kinder to you. I have a similar shot. I''m gonna score your photo higher then my current average...good luck to ya.', '2006-11-02 11:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
