(2988953, 418577, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Even the mountain looks as if it was shaped by winds. Nice contrast between sky, water and the grasses.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Even the mountain looks as if it was shaped by winds. Nice contrast between sky, water and the grasses.', '2006-11-02 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
