(2988976, 417447, 64035, '<td valign="top">I''m not really getting "wind" here, even though I''ve thought about it. Maybe I''m stupid. Also, the composition could, imho, be a little better - I''d like to see more of the guy behind the fire (or whatever it is).</td>', 'I''m not really getting "wind" here, even though I''ve thought about it. Maybe I''m stupid. Also, the composition could, imho, be a little better - I''d like to see more of the guy behind the fire (or whatever it is).', '2006-11-02 11:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
