(2988994, 419050, 64035, '<td valign="top">Blurry, rather than windy, to my eyes, unfortunately. Nice blue sky though, I think.</td>', 'Blurry, rather than windy, to my eyes, unfortunately. Nice blue sky though, I think.', '2006-11-02 11:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
