(2989003, 419155, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but to me this is just a picture of a dog that''s difficult to see - it''s hard to get much in the way of "wind" image here. Cute dog, though.</td>', 'Sorry, but to me this is just a picture of a dog that''s difficult to see - it''s hard to get much in the way of "wind" image here. Cute dog, though.', '2006-11-02 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989010, 419295, 64035, '<td valign="top">You need to freeze the leaf in this shot, I think. It''s really hard to do, but the moving leaf with the blurry background just adds up to a confusing miasma. If the background was still and the leaf blurry, or the leaf still and the background blurry, it would imho be better.</td>', 'You need to freeze the leaf in this shot, I think. It''s really hard to do, but the moving leaf with the blurry background just adds up to a confusing miasma. If the background was still and the leaf blurry, or the leaf still and the background blurry, it would imho be better.', '2006-11-02 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989012, 416199, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. I like the idea, and it certainly meets the challenge, but it''s just a blurry vine to me, without a message or an emotion.</td>', 'Sorry. I like the idea, and it certainly meets the challenge, but it''s just a blurry vine to me, without a message or an emotion.', '2006-11-02 11:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989019, 418916, 64035, '<td valign="top">Too small, too dark (and not dark enought to really be a silhoutte). And only minimal "wind" elements (the flags). It comes across as "nature''s mild irritation", rather than "nature''s wrath".  A difficult shot to take, and I''d certainly have scored it higher if the picture was larger.</td>', 'Too small, too dark (and not dark enought to really be a silhoutte). And only minimal "wind" elements (the flags). It comes across as "nature''s mild irritation", rather than "nature''s wrath".  A difficult shot to take, and I''d certainly have scored it higher if the picture was larger.', '2006-11-02 12:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989067, 418842, 64035, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love the sharpness of the face, and the model''s eye colour.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love the sharpness of the face, and the model''s eye colour.', '2006-11-02 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989068, 419141, 64035, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice, moody shot. I like the blurring of her shawl-thing as it moves in the wind, the expression on her face, the muted colours of the sky and the sea. Excellent!</td>', 'This is such a nice, moody shot. I like the blurring of her shawl-thing as it moves in the wind, the expression on her face, the muted colours of the sky and the sea. Excellent!', '2006-11-02 12:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989069, 419318, 64035, '<td valign="top">This made me smile a lot - always a good thing. Composition is excellent, and I know how hard taking photos of smoke is. Good job!</td>', 'This made me smile a lot - always a good thing. Composition is excellent, and I know how hard taking photos of smoke is. Good job!', '2006-11-02 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989131, 419050, 56254, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo ... very impressionistic in my opinion ... well done</td>', 'I just love this photo ... very impressionistic in my opinion ... well done', '2006-11-02 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
