(2989234, 419181, 65263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like the smooth look of the blades.  The long shutter speed made the blades look nice, but the sky is just slightly blown out.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like the smooth look of the blades.  The long shutter speed made the blades look nice, but the sky is just slightly blown out.  Good job!', '2006-11-02 13:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
