(2989247, 418417, 65263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like it.', '2006-11-02 13:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989253, 416120, 65263, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset.  Great colors!  Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice sunset.  Great colors!  Nice shot.', '2006-11-02 13:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989268, 418999, 65263, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think it could be much better at another time of day.  The sky is overexposed and somewhat distracting because it''s so bright.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think it could be much better at another time of day.  The sky is overexposed and somewhat distracting because it''s so bright.', '2006-11-02 13:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989280, 419380, 65263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the expression.  Made me smile.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the expression.  Made me smile.', '2006-11-02 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989317, 417581, 65263, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly out of focus IMO.  Maybe using a smaller aperture or focusing out a bit further could help?  Also, I think getting a bit closer to the ground could add more depth by making the leading lines in the road wider.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Seems slightly out of focus IMO.  Maybe using a smaller aperture or focusing out a bit further could help?  Also, I think getting a bit closer to the ground could add more depth by making the leading lines in the road wider.  Just a thought.', '2006-11-02 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989362, 418679, 62187, '<td valign="top">Of all the ''Umbrella'' shots, yours is the most convincing and artistic. I like the drab colors that go along with the ''stormy'' look of the photo. Nice job...giving it a 10.</td>', 'Of all the ''Umbrella'' shots, yours is the most convincing and artistic. I like the drab colors that go along with the ''stormy'' look of the photo. Nice job...giving it a 10.', '2006-11-02 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989366, 419141, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve been told in the past that some of my photos are ''dark'' and that DPC''ers like bright, vibrant colors. I''m not like most DPC''ers...I totally love your photo. 10</td>', 'I''ve been told in the past that some of my photos are ''dark'' and that DPC''ers like bright, vibrant colors. I''m not like most DPC''ers...I totally love your photo. 10', '2006-11-02 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989371, 418962, 62187, '<td valign="top">The ''Wind'' is not as convincing as a lot of the other photos...however, I love your observation...giving it a 9.</td>', 'The ''Wind'' is not as convincing as a lot of the other photos...however, I love your observation...giving it a 9.', '2006-11-02 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989384, 418513, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve been here...is it around Gallop or Grant, New Mexico? Regardless, I like the photo. I think it''s a little oversharpened - you can see a lot of jaggies around the flag poles and bottoms of the flags. Could have been blurred slightly to get rid of them. Sky is kinda weird...I still like it...scoring higher then most for this challenge.</td>', 'I think I''ve been here...is it around Gallop or Grant, New Mexico? Regardless, I like the photo. I think it''s a little oversharpened - you can see a lot of jaggies around the flag poles and bottoms of the flags. Could have been blurred slightly to get rid of them. Sky is kinda weird...I still like it...scoring higher then most for this challenge.', '2006-11-02 13:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989547, 418793, 12093, '<td valign="top">Very dark and gloomy...that is what made this effective for me. Good job.</td>', 'Very dark and gloomy...that is what made this effective for me. Good job.', '2006-11-02 14:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989548, 418815, 12093, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo. I love the feel of the wind in the foreground and the underlying image in the back!</td>', 'fantastic photo. I love the feel of the wind in the foreground and the underlying image in the back!', '2006-11-02 14:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989552, 417768, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is perfectly lovely. An interesting abstract feel is created by some realistic elements. I think I see a suggestion of a watery reflection, I think I can see a bird, a face, some eyes, some teeth. The witchy-green ''hair'' at the top is another eye-catching element. I don''t see ''wind'' but instead a kind of super-calm water in the absence of wind. I want to score this a 10 because I think it''s perfect, but I also don''t know how to score it because I can''t find any wind in it, but I like it because you could say wind is defined by its absence &amp; this is the absence of wind. Oh, what the hey. Score: 10.</td>', 'This is perfectly lovely. An interesting abstract feel is created by some realistic elements. I think I see a suggestion of a watery reflection, I think I can see a bird, a face, some eyes, some teeth. The witchy-green ''hair'' at the top is another eye-catching element. I don''t see ''wind'' but instead a kind of super-calm water in the absence of wind. I want to score this a 10 because I think it''s perfect, but I also don''t know how to score it because I can''t find any wind in it, but I like it because you could say wind is defined by its absence & this is the absence of wind. Oh, what the hey. Score: 10.', '2006-11-02 14:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989603, 419192, 63218, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2006-11-02 14:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989606, 416531, 63218, '<td valign="top">the motion blur is nice</td>', 'the motion blur is nice', '2006-11-02 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989615, 419120, 63218, '<td valign="top">the motion blur on the leaf is nice</td>', 'the motion blur on the leaf is nice', '2006-11-02 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989636, 419275, 25742, '<td valign="top">this was probably a nice photo before the heavy edit.</td>', 'this was probably a nice photo before the heavy edit.', '2006-11-02 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989641, 419299, 25742, '<td valign="top">the best "WIND" so far. good luck</td>', 'the best "WIND" so far. good luck', '2006-11-02 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989897, 417041, 60698, '<td valign="top">The processing is heavy here, but I really like the result!! It has a young feeling to it and it''s very artistic IMHO. I love the different textures of the background done in a dirty white and the reddish tones of the sign, the dress and the umbrella. The "Give Way" sign and the half opened door are a touch of genius!  The pose is wonderful and the hair over the face adds even more interest to the composition.</td>', 'The processing is heavy here, but I really like the result!! It has a young feeling to it and it''s very artistic IMHO. I love the different textures of the background done in a dirty white and the reddish tones of the sign, the dress and the umbrella. The "Give Way" sign and the half opened door are a touch of genius!  The pose is wonderful and the hair over the face adds even more interest to the composition.', '2006-11-02 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989922, 418446, 31376, '<td valign="top">I am not sure taht I truly feel the wind in this picture.</td>', 'I am not sure taht I truly feel the wind in this picture.', '2006-11-02 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989971, 418795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea for the challenge - I like having her way on the right and only partially in the frame.  Colors are rich and warm.  I''d have liked to see maybe just a bit of the bubbles in focus, but it''s good the way it is, too.</td>', 'Excellent idea for the challenge - I like having her way on the right and only partially in the frame.  Colors are rich and warm.  I''d have liked to see maybe just a bit of the bubbles in focus, but it''s good the way it is, too.', '2006-11-02 16:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989981, 418679, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice grungy processing and muted colors - really adds to the gray day, icky weather, windy kinda feel of this shot.  Love the lines formed by the poles and the road, too - gives it nice perspective and depth.</td>', 'Nice grungy processing and muted colors - really adds to the gray day, icky weather, windy kinda feel of this shot.  Love the lines formed by the poles and the road, too - gives it nice perspective and depth.', '2006-11-02 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989982, 418752, 64608, '<td valign="top">Great colours</td>', 'Great colours', '2006-11-02 16:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989985, 418890, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - now that''s windy!  I always look at the photo before reading the title - at first I thought it a yo-yo but determined it a balloon, and that it is indeed rather windy because of that.</td>', 'Heh - now that''s windy!  I always look at the photo before reading the title - at first I thought it a yo-yo but determined it a balloon, and that it is indeed rather windy because of that.', '2006-11-02 16:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989989, 418499, 62095, '<td valign="top">Shame that the whole shadow isn''t in the photo</td>', 'Shame that the whole shadow isn''t in the photo', '2006-11-02 16:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989993, 416199, 30982, '<td valign="top">Either it is indeed windy or you need to quit dumping the leftover coffee into the vines'' potter.  An interesting result - I like the repetitive pattern that it forms.</td>', 'Either it is indeed windy or you need to quit dumping the leftover coffee into the vines'' potter.  An interesting result - I like the repetitive pattern that it forms.', '2006-11-02 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990011, 419258, 42179, '<td valign="top">Good act...</td>', 'Good act...', '2006-11-02 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990017, 417768, 42179, '<td valign="top">like the colors. Nice.</td>', 'like the colors. Nice.', '2006-11-02 16:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990025, 419329, 42179, '<td valign="top">Ahh - action photo.  Nice and sharp but I think it would be better to cut it wider. More space on top and to left - 6</td>', 'Ahh - action photo.  Nice and sharp but I think it would be better to cut it wider. More space on top and to left - 6', '2006-11-02 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990033, 419361, 42179, '<td valign="top">Is it a wind tunnel ?</td>', 'Is it a wind tunnel ?', '2006-11-02 16:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990034, 418468, 30982, '<td valign="top">Winds aloft but calm below, it appears.  The trees form a nice silhouette to frame the clouds.</td>', 'Winds aloft but calm below, it appears.  The trees form a nice silhouette to frame the clouds.', '2006-11-02 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990042, 418244, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a bird in flight.  The murky background may be affecting your score a bit, or it may not.  I like the splashes of blue - gives it nice depth.</td>', 'Nice capture of a bird in flight.  The murky background may be affecting your score a bit, or it may not.  I like the splashes of blue - gives it nice depth.', '2006-11-02 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990047, 418521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe not a tempest - it actually looks quite lovely and serene.  It is, however, a very nice shot - well composed and the colors, clarity, and depth are wonderful, particularly when limited to this size presentation.</td>', 'Maybe not a tempest - it actually looks quite lovely and serene.  It is, however, a very nice shot - well composed and the colors, clarity, and depth are wonderful, particularly when limited to this size presentation.', '2006-11-02 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990050, 419254, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very nice portait - but it hasnt much about wind. - 6</td>', 'Very nice portait - but it hasnt much about wind. - 6', '2006-11-02 16:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990053, 418842, 42179, '<td valign="top">Good portait - good wind - 7</td>', 'Good portait - good wind - 7', '2006-11-02 16:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990058, 419197, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes indeed it does!  Lovely subtle interpretation of the challenge.  If you use Photoshop, run an autolevels on this and see if you like the result.  It brightens/lightens it up a bit.</td>', 'Yes indeed it does!  Lovely subtle interpretation of the challenge.  If you use Photoshop, run an autolevels on this and see if you like the result.  It brightens/lightens it up a bit.', '2006-11-02 16:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990065, 419194, 42179, '<td valign="top">Original and nice - 7</td>', 'Original and nice - 7', '2006-11-02 16:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990073, 419388, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the world''s greatest photo, but definitely a sensation of wind a lot of us can relate to.  I still love to do that, especially on cool fall evenings at dusk.  As far as the picture goes, the interior of the car is, well, the interior of a car, which is dull as far as subjects go.</td>', 'Maybe not the world''s greatest photo, but definitely a sensation of wind a lot of us can relate to.  I still love to do that, especially on cool fall evenings at dusk.  As far as the picture goes, the interior of the car is, well, the interior of a car, which is dull as far as subjects go.', '2006-11-02 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990076, 418752, 42179, '<td valign="top">What is it - an angel in the sunshine above the clouds with an umbrella and rain shuit ?<br/>-6</td>', 'What is it - an angel in the sunshine above the clouds with an umbrella and rain shuit ?-6', '2006-11-02 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990077, 419017, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the wisps of hair to show the fall breeze, but I think you needed to show a tree behind the child as a source of the single leaf.  Otherwise it seems a bit oddly out of context to me for some reason.</td>', 'I like the wisps of hair to show the fall breeze, but I think you needed to show a tree behind the child as a source of the single leaf.  Otherwise it seems a bit oddly out of context to me for some reason.', '2006-11-02 17:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990085, 419003, 42179, '<td valign="top">Dont see much wind there - but it''s a nice minimalism which I like :) - 6</td>', 'Dont see much wind there - but it''s a nice minimalism which I like :) - 6', '2006-11-02 17:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990091, 419318, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo IMO - but absolutely no wind ther. - 6</td>', 'Very nice photo IMO - but absolutely no wind ther. - 6', '2006-11-02 17:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990099, 417041, 42179, '<td valign="top">Good act. Love the desaturation, contrast and composition - 9</td>', 'Good act. Love the desaturation, contrast and composition - 9', '2006-11-02 17:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990106, 419019, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-11-02 17:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990109, 419155, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Grace.  I''m gonna have to go see if that''s really a word... it''s not (in English, anyway, according to dictionary.com).  Maybe dervish?  I suspect you''re after the dervish behavior of a dog in motion creating a whirlwind of sorts.  Whether it meets the challenge or not - well, I suspect mostly "not" - I like the accent of the leash and the way the motion pattern of the ground blends with the fur of the dog.</td>', 'Hi Grace.  I''m gonna have to go see if that''s really a word... it''s not (in English, anyway, according to dictionary.com).  Maybe dervish?  I suspect you''re after the dervish behavior of a dog in motion creating a whirlwind of sorts.  Whether it meets the challenge or not - well, I suspect mostly "not" - I like the accent of the leash and the way the motion pattern of the ground blends with the fur of the dog.', '2006-11-02 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990132, 419299, 42179, '<td valign="top">Interesting process - 6</td>', 'Interesting process - 6', '2006-11-02 17:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990134, 417831, 42179, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2006-11-02 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990147, 418793, 42179, '<td valign="top">Wow - it sure looks lika a lot strong wind !</td>', 'Wow - it sure looks lika a lot strong wind !', '2006-11-02 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990151, 418999, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of those trees that shows the prevailing direction of the wind.  Picture itself is a bit on the "washed out" side, though quite often the actual day looks pretty washed out too.</td>', 'Definitely one of those trees that shows the prevailing direction of the wind.  Picture itself is a bit on the "washed out" side, though quite often the actual day looks pretty washed out too.', '2006-11-02 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990168, 419339, 42179, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2006-11-02 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990176, 419303, 42179, '<td valign="top">Dramatic :)</td>', 'Dramatic :)', '2006-11-02 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990264, 417447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the spark trails, though they don''t particularly indicate any wind direction since they seem to be flying all over the place.</td>', 'Like the spark trails, though they don''t particularly indicate any wind direction since they seem to be flying all over the place.', '2006-11-02 17:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990269, 419362, 30982, '<td valign="top">First impression is that she''s holding something long and narrow and about to throw it off into the sea.  But I realize she''s holding her arms out.  Definitely depicts wind well!  Since I suspect you set this up, I''d have preferred leaving out the weed in the forground, or chosing something that stood out a bit more from the rocks.  Great sea and sky in this, and the touches of color in the trees and the roof on the point add nicely.</td>', 'First impression is that she''s holding something long and narrow and about to throw it off into the sea.  But I realize she''s holding her arms out.  Definitely depicts wind well!  Since I suspect you set this up, I''d have preferred leaving out the weed in the forground, or chosing something that stood out a bit more from the rocks.  Great sea and sky in this, and the touches of color in the trees and the roof on the point add nicely.', '2006-11-02 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990273, 418949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice color, lovely sky, good composition.  Definitely depicts wind well.</td>', 'Nice color, lovely sky, good composition.  Definitely depicts wind well.', '2006-11-02 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990276, 417191, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition with the corners cut off and the flag filling the frame.  Snow, eh?  Brr!  Meets challenge well - good shot.</td>', 'I really like the composition with the corners cut off and the flag filling the frame.  Snow, eh?  Brr!  Meets challenge well - good shot.', '2006-11-02 17:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990306, 418341, 43212, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me giggle. Nice example of bokeh as well.</td>', 'This picture makes me giggle. Nice example of bokeh as well.', '2006-11-02 17:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990314, 417867, 43212, '<td valign="top">I love how everything is kind of dark, then the water is lit up.</td>', 'I love how everything is kind of dark, then the water is lit up.', '2006-11-02 17:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990321, 417077, 43212, '<td valign="top">Not neccesarily an example of wind. Beautiful photo though.</td>', 'Not neccesarily an example of wind. Beautiful photo though.', '2006-11-02 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990331, 418152, 43212, '<td valign="top">No wind, That tumbleweed (if that''s what it is) has obviously not moved in awhile.</td>', 'No wind, That tumbleweed (if that''s what it is) has obviously not moved in awhile.', '2006-11-02 18:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990338, 419124, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice depiction of a bright, windy, warm day.  If you take this into Photoshop and use levels to darken the darks a bit, it really makes it much richer and stronger.  Try it and see if you like it better or not.</td>', 'Very nice depiction of a bright, windy, warm day.  If you take this into Photoshop and use levels to darken the darks a bit, it really makes it much richer and stronger.  Try it and see if you like it better or not.', '2006-11-02 18:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990343, 419391, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite nice - I like it.  Just enough detail to see the veins in the leaf which is cool.</td>', 'Quite nice - I like it.  Just enough detail to see the veins in the leaf which is cool.', '2006-11-02 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990347, 419254, 30982, '<td valign="top">Multichallenge entry - would work for Bokeh, Wind, and portrait in landscape mode.  Nicely done as well.</td>', 'Multichallenge entry - would work for Bokeh, Wind, and portrait in landscape mode.  Nicely done as well.', '2006-11-02 18:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990365, 419296, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but is lacking a bit in technicals.  Good job of following the rule of thirds for the placement of the windmill but it looks as if it may be a bit underexposed which makes it noisy.  If you take it into photoshop and use levels to deepen the darks a bit, you''ll lose some detail in the ground but increase the contrast and enhance the color in the sky - it will have a lot richer look to it.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but is lacking a bit in technicals.  Good job of following the rule of thirds for the placement of the windmill but it looks as if it may be a bit underexposed which makes it noisy.  If you take it into photoshop and use levels to deepen the darks a bit, you''ll lose some detail in the ground but increase the contrast and enhance the color in the sky - it will have a lot richer look to it.', '2006-11-02 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990370, 418623, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and great job catching the sun as it''s setting.  My nit with this otherwise gorgeous shot is they way the surf line catches her right at the point where her legs attach to her body - when this first opened, I was trying to figure out what happened to her lower half, since the legs looked like a reflection of her upper body, not legs.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and great job catching the sun as it''s setting.  My nit with this otherwise gorgeous shot is they way the surf line catches her right at the point where her legs attach to her body - when this first opened, I was trying to figure out what happened to her lower half, since the legs looked like a reflection of her upper body, not legs.', '2006-11-02 18:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990371, 419299, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a good shot for a Wind challenge!  Nicely seen - great capture.</td>', 'Definitely a good shot for a Wind challenge!  Nicely seen - great capture.', '2006-11-02 18:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990419, 418969, 30982, '<td valign="top">Calm and serene - the birds are well placed in the frame.</td>', 'Calm and serene - the birds are well placed in the frame.', '2006-11-02 18:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990423, 419074, 30982, '<td valign="top">The woody is well posed and framed in this shot, but I don''t get any impression that the kite is flying.  Good title, though!</td>', 'The woody is well posed and framed in this shot, but I don''t get any impression that the kite is flying.  Good title, though!', '2006-11-02 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990430, 419339, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good shot of a pretty girl!  Hair does the trick for meeting the challenge - like the light, too.</td>', 'Good shot of a pretty girl!  Hair does the trick for meeting the challenge - like the light, too.', '2006-11-02 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990431, 419380, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely portrait!  Makes me smile.</td>', 'What a lovely portrait!  Makes me smile.', '2006-11-02 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990436, 418907, 30982, '<td valign="top">DOF is excellent in this - nice depiction of a blustery, cool day.  The flip of the tail of the coat is what makes this.</td>', 'DOF is excellent in this - nice depiction of a blustery, cool day.  The flip of the tail of the coat is what makes this.', '2006-11-02 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990445, 418341, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Hello, Mr Toole.  I like the comic aspect of this quite a bit - kinda like those old movies but with cars and mailboxes.  Your pose is quite convincing, particularly the look of grim determination.</td>', 'LOL!  Hello, Mr Toole.  I like the comic aspect of this quite a bit - kinda like those old movies but with cars and mailboxes.  Your pose is quite convincing, particularly the look of grim determination.', '2006-11-02 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990449, 418375, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and pretty well executed!</td>', 'Neat idea and pretty well executed!', '2006-11-02 18:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990457, 419298, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed - definitely imparts "blustery"!</td>', 'Nicely composed - definitely imparts "blustery"!', '2006-11-02 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990460, 419066, 30982, '<td valign="top">There sure are a lot of them!  Nice stop motion and good clarity on these guys.</td>', 'There sure are a lot of them!  Nice stop motion and good clarity on these guys.', '2006-11-02 18:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990508, 418842, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice demonstation of wind.  I like the way it''s whipping across her face and the simple background.</td>', 'Nice demonstation of wind.  I like the way it''s whipping across her face and the simple background.', '2006-11-02 18:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990520, 418513, 42495, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, I''m curious to see where it''s located.  Nice sharp colors.  Crop is a bit tight for me.</td>', 'Interesting picture, I''m curious to see where it''s located.  Nice sharp colors.  Crop is a bit tight for me.', '2006-11-02 18:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990528, 418571, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is actually pretty funny.  I''m not sure how much wind there is, but it''s technically well done and meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is actually pretty funny.  I''m not sure how much wind there is, but it''s technically well done and meets the challenge.', '2006-11-02 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990533, 417415, 42495, '<td valign="top">It looks like your model was having a blast!  Nice job on the B&amp;W.</td>', 'It looks like your model was having a blast!  Nice job on the B&W.', '2006-11-02 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990539, 417819, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of wind.  Composition and blue/yellow work well together.</td>', 'Good demonstration of wind.  Composition and blue/yellow work well together.', '2006-11-02 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990548, 418803, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of the crashing waves.  Interesting that you used B&amp;W, but I really like it.  The dark area in lower left is drawing my attention from the waves (just a bit!).</td>', 'Nice catch of the crashing waves.  Interesting that you used B&W, but I really like it.  The dark area in lower left is drawing my attention from the waves (just a bit!).', '2006-11-02 18:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990559, 419141, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great job in pulling the model/foreground away from the waves and clouds.  Moody colors in background work great with the model''s pose.  One of the best in the challenge so far!</td>', 'Great job in pulling the model/foreground away from the waves and clouds.  Moody colors in background work great with the model''s pose.  One of the best in the challenge so far!', '2006-11-02 18:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990571, 419192, 42495, '<td valign="top">The natural lighting looks great on the curtain.  The fall colors on other side of window and slight movement suggest a warm South breeze.</td>', 'The natural lighting looks great on the curtain.  The fall colors on other side of window and slight movement suggest a warm South breeze.', '2006-11-02 18:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990588, 417041, 42495, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and I like the look.  However, the processing on the model seems a bit overdone and picture seems unbalanced with more color in center and left.  6</td>', 'Interesting idea and I like the look.  However, the processing on the model seems a bit overdone and picture seems unbalanced with more color in center and left.  6', '2006-11-02 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990603, 418966, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job of processing using B&amp;W.  The building seems like it''s being sucked into the tree, even though the wind is blowing towards the right.  Good expression of wind!</td>', 'Nice job of processing using B&W.  The building seems like it''s being sucked into the tree, even though the wind is blowing towards the right.  Good expression of wind!', '2006-11-02 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990634, 418623, 55224, '<td valign="top">wow, i really like this picture. the color and the contrast. wow</td>', 'wow, i really like this picture. the color and the contrast. wow', '2006-11-02 19:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990744, 418521, 64929, '<td valign="top">Wowzers....looks like an elegant painting....Bravo! (9)</td>', 'Wowzers....looks like an elegant painting....Bravo! (9)', '2006-11-02 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990757, 418623, 64929, '<td valign="top">I especially like how the scarf the model is waving matches perfectly with the colors of the sunset....Bravo!  My top pick : )</td>', 'I especially like how the scarf the model is waving matches perfectly with the colors of the sunset....Bravo!  My top pick : )', '2006-11-02 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990904, 419391, 2158, '<td valign="top">Very nice and original.  The colours are beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice and original.  The colours are beautiful.', '2006-11-02 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991081, 419254, 24528, '<td valign="top">Beautful Eyes</td>', 'Beautful Eyes', '2006-11-02 20:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991155, 419393, 58683, '<td valign="top">Cute idea! The only thing that gets in the way is that the surroundings you''ve chosen look pretty still considering the situation... I like it though. Might have been nice to see the buildings all black as well. The light sections distract a bit.</td>', 'Cute idea! The only thing that gets in the way is that the surroundings you''ve chosen look pretty still considering the situation... I like it though. Might have been nice to see the buildings all black as well. The light sections distract a bit.', '2006-11-02 20:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991160, 417581, 30982, '<td valign="top">While some may not notice, one can see the bend of the grasses in the prevailing direction of the wind.  What I like about this is the misty gray day - adds to the notion of a chilly breeze blowing.</td>', 'While some may not notice, one can see the bend of the grasses in the prevailing direction of the wind.  What I like about this is the misty gray day - adds to the notion of a chilly breeze blowing.', '2006-11-02 20:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991165, 418184, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Pricelsess!  Wonderful depiction of a very breezy day and just a delightful expression!</td>', 'LOL!  Pricelsess!  Wonderful depiction of a very breezy day and just a delightful expression!', '2006-11-02 20:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991168, 418952, 30982, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the leaves blowing shots so far - because it has context!  IT''s a simple shot, but it works well for this challenge, and as an added bonus, makes one wonder about the person across the street - sure seems awfully deserted - what is he/she doing there?</td>', 'My favorite of the leaves blowing shots so far - because it has context!  IT''s a simple shot, but it works well for this challenge, and as an added bonus, makes one wonder about the person across the street - sure seems awfully deserted - what is he/she doing there?', '2006-11-02 20:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991170, 418952, 58683, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured movement. The setting, and car and the buildings aren''t necessarily the most appealing backdrops but makes up for it with the swirling leaves. One of the better expressions of wind in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely captured movement. The setting, and car and the buildings aren''t necessarily the most appealing backdrops but makes up for it with the swirling leaves. One of the better expressions of wind in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991172, 417348, 30982, '<td valign="top">The rips in the flag attest to the wind and to both the persistence and prevalence of it, as well as the persistence of the flag itself.  I like the focus such that you see the drops on teh grasses, and I like being able to read the date on the headstone as well.  Nicely presented.</td>', 'The rips in the flag attest to the wind and to both the persistence and prevalence of it, as well as the persistence of the flag itself.  I like the focus such that you see the drops on teh grasses, and I like being able to read the date on the headstone as well.  Nicely presented.', '2006-11-02 20:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991175, 418499, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great capture to fulfill that idea.  Nicely done on all counts.</td>', 'Great idea, great capture to fulfill that idea.  Nicely done on all counts.', '2006-11-02 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991181, 419170, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Excellent job of catching the leaves all over the place - some static and frozen, some still definitely moving.  Added bonuses of the yellow jacket to echo the leaves, and the windblown hair.  Truly creates the feel of a crisp fall day in the city!</td>', 'Very nice!  Excellent job of catching the leaves all over the place - some static and frozen, some still definitely moving.  Added bonuses of the yellow jacket to echo the leaves, and the windblown hair.  Truly creates the feel of a crisp fall day in the city!', '2006-11-02 20:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991185, 418793, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge and a darn fine picture to boot.  Love the sweep and arch of the tree, the solitary bench, and the pier in the distance.  Exceptional clarity for a presentation of this size.  Great mood of a storm created/enhanced by the toning.</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge and a darn fine picture to boot.  Love the sweep and arch of the tree, the solitary bench, and the pier in the distance.  Exceptional clarity for a presentation of this size.  Great mood of a storm created/enhanced by the toning.', '2006-11-02 20:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991188, 418891, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish the shutter speed was a bit slower, to get a sense of the movement direction of the snow flakes.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish the shutter speed was a bit slower, to get a sense of the movement direction of the snow flakes.', '2006-11-02 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991189, 418905, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely, quiet, and effective presentation.  No movement at the moment is apparent, but the past presence of the wind is clearly defined.  Great light.</td>', 'A lovely, quiet, and effective presentation.  No movement at the moment is apparent, but the past presence of the wind is clearly defined.  Great light.', '2006-11-02 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991191, 419202, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective - well captured with the focus on the flag.  Good color and contrast.</td>', 'An interesting perspective - well captured with the focus on the flag.  Good color and contrast.', '2006-11-02 20:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991193, 419050, 58683, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. Captures both the feeling of movement as well as fantastic fall colours. Love it. I can''t help but wonder how much was camera vs wind movement though.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. Captures both the feeling of movement as well as fantastic fall colours. Love it. I can''t help but wonder how much was camera vs wind movement though.', '2006-11-02 20:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991198, 417924, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very effective presentation of the wrath and power Mother Nature can dish out.  The contrast of the damage caused by what was probably a powerful storm against the clear blue sky of a lovely day adds impact to the picture.</td>', 'A very effective presentation of the wrath and power Mother Nature can dish out.  The contrast of the damage caused by what was probably a powerful storm against the clear blue sky of a lovely day adds impact to the picture.', '2006-11-02 21:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991201, 416120, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of some awesome clouds!</td>', 'Very nice capture of some awesome clouds!', '2006-11-02 21:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991212, 419293, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely presentation!  The feel of movement is nicely done, particularly with the lone stationary plant near the center.</td>', 'Lovely presentation!  The feel of movement is nicely done, particularly with the lone stationary plant near the center.', '2006-11-02 21:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991214, 418417, 30982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful animal and indeed a pose anyone who''s owned a dog will recognize.  Nice light, great focus, and perfectly processed to keep the fur soft yet defined.</td>', 'A beautiful animal and indeed a pose anyone who''s owned a dog will recognize.  Nice light, great focus, and perfectly processed to keep the fur soft yet defined.', '2006-11-02 21:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991222, 419170, 48890, '<td valign="top">The runner''s phase of movement is unlucky, and the composition is a bit of a mess.</td>', 'The runner''s phase of movement is unlucky, and the composition is a bit of a mess.', '2006-11-02 21:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991224, 419367, 30982, '<td valign="top">Marvelous clarity - what a great day that must have been for sailing.  I love the angle of the light in this, too.</td>', 'Marvelous clarity - what a great day that must have been for sailing.  I love the angle of the light in this, too.', '2006-11-02 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991225, 418961, 30982, '<td valign="top">A classic shot very well done!</td>', 'A classic shot very well done!', '2006-11-02 21:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991233, 419318, 30982, '<td valign="top">The only thing undermining your title and intended impression that the flames did not withstand the wind is the smoke is rising straight up.  Were there a breeze, one might expect the smoke to follow with it.  The clarity and detail on the match heads make them quite intriguing and I like the composition.</td>', 'The only thing undermining your title and intended impression that the flames did not withstand the wind is the smoke is rising straight up.  Were there a breeze, one might expect the smoke to follow with it.  The clarity and detail on the match heads make them quite intriguing and I like the composition.', '2006-11-02 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991241, 418160, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful with a gorgeous sky - I like the patterns created in the clouds by the winds aloft.</td>', 'Very peaceful with a gorgeous sky - I like the patterns created in the clouds by the winds aloft.', '2006-11-02 21:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991342, 419344, 58683, '<td valign="top">What really appeals to me here is the combination of the person looking incredibly cold and the movement of the tree. Love the motion blur there. It just communicates the concept of strong wind so well to me, more than any other photo in the challenge. One of my faves. Well done.</td>', 'What really appeals to me here is the combination of the person looking incredibly cold and the movement of the tree. Love the motion blur there. It just communicates the concept of strong wind so well to me, more than any other photo in the challenge. One of my faves. Well done.', '2006-11-02 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991349, 419141, 58683, '<td valign="top">The dark sky is pretty much what sells me on this shot. The grey ocean helps, but I think it''s the sky. Not taking anything away from your lovely model of course. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'The dark sky is pretty much what sells me on this shot. The grey ocean helps, but I think it''s the sky. Not taking anything away from your lovely model of course. Beautiful photo.', '2006-11-02 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991382, 418869, 32147, '<td valign="top">very interesting concept.  Way to think out of the box!</td>', 'very interesting concept.  Way to think out of the box!', '2006-11-02 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991385, 419323, 32147, '<td valign="top">nice shot - great bokeh too!</td>', 'nice shot - great bokeh too!', '2006-11-02 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991393, 417041, 32147, '<td valign="top">great shot that perfectly illustrates the theme - however, I feel that this is way overprocessed.</td>', 'great shot that perfectly illustrates the theme - however, I feel that this is way overprocessed.', '2006-11-02 21:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991398, 418823, 32147, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - color, composition, lighting, and even the frame are tasteful and appealing.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this shot - color, composition, lighting, and even the frame are tasteful and appealing.  Well done!', '2006-11-02 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991414, 418916, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge as far as showing a windy day!  A bit on the not-all-that-interesting side as far as the subject, though it does show an impending storm (at least that''s what I see).  You can use up to 640 pixels on the longest side - this looks a bit small.  If you have questions about how to size a submission, there''s a good tutorial under the "Learn" section, or you can ask in the forums and someone will help you out.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge as far as showing a windy day!  A bit on the not-all-that-interesting side as far as the subject, though it does show an impending storm (at least that''s what I see).  You can use up to 640 pixels on the longest side - this looks a bit small.  If you have questions about how to size a submission, there''s a good tutorial under the "Learn" section, or you can ask in the forums and someone will help you out.', '2006-11-02 21:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991420, 418630, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting - very nice red/pink color of the blooms to accompany the red of her hair.</td>', 'Lovely setting - very nice red/pink color of the blooms to accompany the red of her hair.', '2006-11-02 21:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991443, 417900, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute!  And definitely shows a bit o'' wind in the area.  In fact his hair is so windblown, you can''t tell what the leash attaches to!  From a technical standpoint, you may want to apply a bit (or a bit more) sharpening and level the shot so the curb is horizontal.</td>', 'Cute!  And definitely shows a bit o'' wind in the area.  In fact his hair is so windblown, you can''t tell what the leash attaches to!  From a technical standpoint, you may want to apply a bit (or a bit more) sharpening and level the shot so the curb is horizontal.', '2006-11-02 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991453, 419258, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice color coordination between the young man''s clothes and the umbrella, and very nice light to shoot this - especially the way it shines through the front of his shirt to emphasize it "blowing in the breeze".  The holding the hat on isn''t as convincing as it could be - might have been fun to have the hat flying through the air, but would have been a whole lot more difficult to pull off.</td>', 'Nice color coordination between the young man''s clothes and the umbrella, and very nice light to shoot this - especially the way it shines through the front of his shirt to emphasize it "blowing in the breeze".  The holding the hat on isn''t as convincing as it could be - might have been fun to have the hat flying through the air, but would have been a whole lot more difficult to pull off.', '2006-11-02 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991455, 417381, 30982, '<td valign="top">Totally title-dependent to depict wind/meet the challenge, (looks enchanting, not stormy to me) but a very intriguing and well done/processed shot.</td>', 'Totally title-dependent to depict wind/meet the challenge, (looks enchanting, not stormy to me) but a very intriguing and well done/processed shot.', '2006-11-02 22:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991462, 418183, 30982, '<td valign="top">The glimpse of the trees just above the shoreline add to the feeling of the power of the wind here.  By the way, this looks great in black and white as well.</td>', 'The glimpse of the trees just above the shoreline add to the feeling of the power of the wind here.  By the way, this looks great in black and white as well.', '2006-11-02 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991466, 418162, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and color - the different angle with the border makes this distinctive from some of the other flag shots.</td>', 'Excellent detail and color - the different angle with the border makes this distinctive from some of the other flag shots.', '2006-11-02 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991475, 419319, 30982, '<td valign="top">The black and white helps convey the stormy feeling this imparts, and the bend of the trees in the distance emphasize the direction of the wind.  The water in the foreground has almost a painted look to it which is kinda cool!</td>', 'The black and white helps convey the stormy feeling this imparts, and the bend of the trees in the distance emphasize the direction of the wind.  The water in the foreground has almost a painted look to it which is kinda cool!', '2006-11-02 22:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991488, 417827, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the wispy cloud looks like it''s "blowing" at the windmill in a way.  Try adding a bit more sharpness to this, then use levels and brighten a bit and see if you like it.  The sharpening "crisps" it up and the levels adds a bit of contrast.</td>', 'I like how the wispy cloud looks like it''s "blowing" at the windmill in a way.  Try adding a bit more sharpness to this, then use levels and brighten a bit and see if you like it.  The sharpening "crisps" it up and the levels adds a bit of contrast.', '2006-11-02 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991530, 418347, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured - crisp, clean, good color, good use of DOF.</td>', 'Nicely captured - crisp, clean, good color, good use of DOF.', '2006-11-02 22:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991534, 417768, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful depiction of motion with the stable, solid limbs to provide a base.</td>', 'Wonderful depiction of motion with the stable, solid limbs to provide a base.', '2006-11-02 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991541, 419344, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure!  Your model did a good job of shivering (it seems) to add to the feel of a cold blustery wind.</td>', 'Nice long exposure!  Your model did a good job of shivering (it seems) to add to the feel of a cold blustery wind.', '2006-11-02 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991545, 418871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice shot - well seen and captured.  Good job with the tonality of this particularly when snow can be so difficult.  I do love the way the wind sculpts snow - it''s quite fascinating!</td>', 'Quite a nice shot - well seen and captured.  Good job with the tonality of this particularly when snow can be so difficult.  I do love the way the wind sculpts snow - it''s quite fascinating!', '2006-11-02 22:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991548, 418869, 48972, '<td valign="top">Seems a little to washed out.  I really like the front leaves.</td>', 'Seems a little to washed out.  I really like the front leaves.', '2006-11-02 22:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991550, 418962, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful take on the flag in the wind theme.  The designs created by the reflection are fascinating!!</td>', 'Wonderful take on the flag in the wind theme.  The designs created by the reflection are fascinating!!', '2006-11-02 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991552, 417077, 48972, '<td valign="top">Like the picture, the border throws it off a bit though..IMO.</td>', 'Like the picture, the border throws it off a bit though..IMO.', '2006-11-02 22:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991554, 419344, 32147, '<td valign="top">almost creepy - but cool.</td>', 'almost creepy - but cool.', '2006-11-02 22:29:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2991555, 418498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you did this, but you did it very well!</td>', 'Don''t know how you did this, but you did it very well!', '2006-11-02 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991558, 419332, 48972, '<td valign="top">Great clarity.</td>', 'Great clarity.', '2006-11-02 22:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991560, 418309, 30982, '<td valign="top">The addition of the fence in the corner gives basis to this - very good job of capturing the leaves in flight.</td>', 'The addition of the fence in the corner gives basis to this - very good job of capturing the leaves in flight.', '2006-11-02 22:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991564, 418304, 48972, '<td valign="top">Like the picture.  I would rather see this a little closer.</td>', 'Like the picture.  I would rather see this a little closer.', '2006-11-02 22:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991567, 417415, 48972, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-11-02 22:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991568, 417831, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely in black and white.  I like the contrast of the stone against the softness of her dress and hair - both affected by the wind though quite differently.</td>', 'Lovely in black and white.  I like the contrast of the stone against the softness of her dress and hair - both affected by the wind though quite differently.', '2006-11-02 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991575, 418679, 32147, '<td valign="top">I find the dodge and burn adjustments used here to be very noticable, and it takes away from the photo as a whole.  It just feels overdone</td>', 'I find the dodge and burn adjustments used here to be very noticable, and it takes away from the photo as a whole.  It just feels overdone', '2006-11-02 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991577, 418472, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very brisk - the slight tears at the end of the flag attest to the fact the wind is often brisk where this flies.</td>', 'Very brisk - the slight tears at the end of the flag attest to the fact the wind is often brisk where this flies.', '2006-11-02 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991578, 418867, 48972, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2006-11-02 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991580, 419323, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh on this - that and the diagonal created in the background coupled with the opposite diagonal for the path of the single leaf make this a nice composition.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh on this - that and the diagonal created in the background coupled with the opposite diagonal for the path of the single leaf make this a nice composition.', '2006-11-02 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991581, 418752, 48972, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-11-02 22:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991585, 418472, 32147, '<td valign="top">great detail.  It feels like the white balance could use a bit more red though.  Almost seems like there is too much blue tint.</td>', 'great detail.  It feels like the white balance could use a bit more red though.  Almost seems like there is too much blue tint.', '2006-11-02 22:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
