(2999210, 418498, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  I like the real feel of wind and "g" force here.  To me the composition is a small issue as pretty much your subject (facial features) are almost dead center).  I could see this with a lot more negative space, and it would be stronger.  Still a solid effort earned an 8 from me.</td>', 'Return for comment.  I like the real feel of wind and "g" force here.  To me the composition is a small issue as pretty much your subject (facial features) are almost dead center).  I could see this with a lot more negative space, and it would be stronger.  Still a solid effort earned an 8 from me.', '2006-11-04 22:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
