(2999411, 419299, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Great scene and great long exposure to show wind.  To me, the sand is the highlight, and the strong contrast of the clouds weakens that a bit.  In fact, the sky/clouds is so contrasty, it looks a bit unnatural.  Had you burned it it more, darker blue, it would have competed less with the sand.  Constructive criticism aside, it''s a strong photo, worthy of an 8.</td>', 'Return for comment.  Great scene and great long exposure to show wind.  To me, the sand is the highlight, and the strong contrast of the clouds weakens that a bit.  In fact, the sky/clouds is so contrasty, it looks a bit unnatural.  Had you burned it it more, darker blue, it would have competed less with the sand.  Constructive criticism aside, it''s a strong photo, worthy of an 8.', '2006-11-04 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
