(3001292, 418304, 30861, '<td valign="top">Compositionally this is fascinating. Ignore the foreground elements, and the composition is basically symmetrical, centered subject and centered horizon. But it''s really two sub-compositions, with the land/sea horizontally striated into thirds and the sky/lighthouse a bottom-weighted rectangle with the lighthouse centered horizontally. What makes the composition work, in the end, is the lighter clouds at the top, and usually that''s a no-no, with images working best with the top darkened to contain the eye and redirect it into the center. But in this case the eye would stop dead at the lighthouse without the luminosity at the top, which causes us to swoop up, as it were.<br/> <br/>Probably more than youw anted to hear :-) My only real complaint here is the purplish cast to the sky, which seems a little overdone, but it''s not a big deal. Very strong image.</td>', 'Compositionally this is fascinating. Ignore the foreground elements, and the composition is basically symmetrical, centered subject and centered horizon. But it''s really two sub-compositions, with the land/sea horizontally striated into thirds and the sky/lighthouse a bottom-weighted rectangle with the lighthouse centered horizontally. What makes the composition work, in the end, is the lighter clouds at the top, and usually that''s a no-no, with images working best with the top darkened to contain the eye and redirect it into the center. But in this case the eye would stop dead at the lighthouse without the luminosity at the top, which causes us to swoop up, as it were. Probably more than youw anted to hear :-) My only real complaint here is the purplish cast to the sky, which seems a little overdone, but it''s not a big deal. Very strong image.', '2006-11-05 10:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3001308, 417041, 14614, '<td valign="top">gritty feel(a bit much on the model but great on the rest), like the punch of red throughout, like the face full of hair as it adds to the wind, sign is an added element that make this a full story -- one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'gritty feel(a bit much on the model but great on the rest), like the punch of red throughout, like the face full of hair as it adds to the wind, sign is an added element that make this a full story -- one of my favorites this challenge', '2006-11-05 10:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
