(3004430, 418417, 19982, '<td valign="top">I actually kinda like the shallow DOF here.  I would like to see the dog''s left eye a bit more (right side of image).  Overall I like the image.  What would make me vote it down is that it just doesn''t say "wind" to me at all.  I read your post that this was the windiest day of the year, but to someone just looking at the image, not knowing that it was windy that day, I''d never guess there was any wind at all.</td>', 'I actually kinda like the shallow DOF here.  I would like to see the dog''s left eye a bit more (right side of image).  Overall I like the image.  What would make me vote it down is that it just doesn''t say "wind" to me at all.  I read your post that this was the windiest day of the year, but to someone just looking at the image, not knowing that it was windy that day, I''d never guess there was any wind at all.', '2006-11-06 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
