(3004462, 419178, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this image!  Beautiful.</td>', 'Love this image!  Beautiful.', '2006-11-06 00:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3004467, 418417, 48890, '<td valign="top">The dog is cute, and, technically, this is a good image.  However, as far as photography is concerned, this is just another dog picture, a good candidate for a family album, but boring for me to see.  I don''t see any indication of wind here, nor do I see that it is "sniffing at the wind" - the dog is just looking at something for all I know.</td>', 'The dog is cute, and, technically, this is a good image.  However, as far as photography is concerned, this is just another dog picture, a good candidate for a family album, but boring for me to see.  I don''t see any indication of wind here, nor do I see that it is "sniffing at the wind" - the dog is just looking at something for all I know.', '2006-11-06 00:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
