(3006422, 418623, 4226, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Shrink:</b></div><hr/><i> Surprised this didnt score higher. Not my fault!. I thought this was outstanding!Well done. How did you light the face? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I was using EX550 flash. Exposure was set for the background and then adjusted flash power to expose the subject</td>', 'Originally posted by Shrink: Surprised this didnt score higher. Not my fault!. I thought this was outstanding!Well done. How did you light the face?  I was using EX550 flash. Exposure was set for the background and then adjusted flash power to expose the subject', '2006-11-06 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
