(3007569, 419141, 30982, '<td valign="top">It is indeed a lovely photograph with all the really good photographic qualities (and it''s not too dark and I don''t think she needs any more light on her face.)  The best part about this, though, is that your daughter is a very beautiful young woman and she loves her dad enough to hang out in the cold with him.  And she looks like she''s inherited his joie de vie, too.</td>', 'It is indeed a lovely photograph with all the really good photographic qualities (and it''s not too dark and I don''t think she needs any more light on her face.)  The best part about this, though, is that your daughter is a very beautiful young woman and she loves her dad enough to hang out in the cold with him.  And she looks like she''s inherited his joie de vie, too.', '2006-11-06 18:18:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3007574, 418630, 47274, '<td valign="top">i like it but your face looks very stressed as iff there is too much wind and oyur about to fall but if your face had been a little less stressed and more carefree i would absolutly love this!</td>', 'i like it but your face looks very stressed as iff there is too much wind and oyur about to fall but if your face had been a little less stressed and more carefree i would absolutly love this!', '2006-11-06 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
