(3007694, 418623, 20557, '<td valign="top">Wow, I fully expected this to ribbon.  My only suggestion would be to have to model wear lighter clothes.  I find her lower half blends into the shadows a bit.</td>', 'Wow, I fully expected this to ribbon.  My only suggestion would be to have to model wear lighter clothes.  I find her lower half blends into the shadows a bit.', '2006-11-06 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
