(3008931, 419365, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great candid, and I love the black and white.</td>', 'Great candid, and I love the black and white.', '2006-11-07 00:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008936, 416120, 7756, '<td valign="top">Sorry guys. The wind reference was the red sky in the morning being a storm warning and the storm clouds overhead. Bit of a long shot.</td>', 'Sorry guys. The wind reference was the red sky in the morning being a storm warning and the storm clouds overhead. Bit of a long shot.', '2006-11-07 00:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008940, 416120, 15711, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really speak wind to me, but man, it''s a gorgeous powerful image!</td>', 'This doesn''t really speak wind to me, but man, it''s a gorgeous powerful image!', '2006-11-07 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008970, 416120, 42013, '<td valign="top">Spectacular sunset and love the sense of scale provided by the boats.</td>', 'Spectacular sunset and love the sense of scale provided by the boats.', '2006-11-07 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008981, 418952, 42013, '<td valign="top">The leaves seem as if someone just rushed by on the sidewalk. I really like the shot and the movement of the leaves contrasts nicely with the solid/stationary buildings/car/light post.</td>', 'The leaves seem as if someone just rushed by on the sidewalk. I really like the shot and the movement of the leaves contrasts nicely with the solid/stationary buildings/car/light post.', '2006-11-07 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008988, 419275, 42013, '<td valign="top">You really have developed a nice eye for compoosition. The minimalist approace is nice because the kite looks as if it trying to escape. Maybe a little more room on the left would have been nice, but im not sure what your shooting constraints were. Nice pic overall.</td>', 'You really have developed a nice eye for compoosition. The minimalist approace is nice because the kite looks as if it trying to escape. Maybe a little more room on the left would have been nice, but im not sure what your shooting constraints were. Nice pic overall.', '2006-11-07 00:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009041, 419155, 45475, '<td valign="top">Cruel score. Judging by the average vote from us commenters, I suspect a lot of other people aren''t really ''looking''. Shame.</td>', 'Cruel score. Judging by the average vote from us commenters, I suspect a lot of other people aren''t really ''looking''. Shame.', '2006-11-07 00:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009409, 418375, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is unbelievably underrated (IMO). This is just so good and a great take on the challenge.</td>', 'This is unbelievably underrated (IMO). This is just so good and a great take on the challenge.', '2006-11-07 04:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009449, 419141, 34938, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 10...thoroughly deserved ribbon...YOU ARE ON FIRE! Now isn''t there something you are busy with at the moment? You need to go to it so some of us can share the spoils... :-) Many More Rudy</td>', 'Gave you a 10...thoroughly deserved ribbon...YOU ARE ON FIRE! Now isn''t there something you are busy with at the moment? You need to go to it so some of us can share the spoils... :-) Many More Rudy', '2006-11-07 05:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009451, 418842, 34938, '<td valign="top">You just missed out my friend...you are so good at these portraits...your learning must be working..hope you are well...congrats on 4th</td>', 'You just missed out my friend...you are so good at these portraits...your learning must be working..hope you are well...congrats on 4th', '2006-11-07 05:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009675, 419141, 64571, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - Congrats on your much deserved ribbon!  You are on a roll, stay on it, Rudy!!!</td>', 'Fantastic - Congrats on your much deserved ribbon!  You are on a roll, stay on it, Rudy!!!', '2006-11-07 08:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3009700, 419141, 67268, '<td valign="top">What a striking image.  I think I detect some lightening on her face already.  Someone thought it required some.  Ones eye goes straight to her face.  The light, movement and structure all all beautiful.  Do some fashion, if you don''t already.</td>', 'What a striking image.  I think I detect some lightening on her face already.  Someone thought it required some.  Ones eye goes straight to her face.  The light, movement and structure all all beautiful.  Do some fashion, if you don''t already.', '2006-11-07 08:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
