(3021460, 418577, 63972, '<td valign="top"><i>-Wish it was straight,<br/>-Also....the shore line should be straightened to horizontal.<br/>-On the down side, the horizon is substantially slanted to the left.</i> <br/> <br/>Darn! I thought it was straight... I think the slanted figure of the  mountain just tricked me. The funniest thing is that I QA this type of stuff as part of my job, and I''m sometimes blamed to be very fussy... Better to get my eyes checked I guess.  Thanks for the comments...</td>', '-Wish it was straight,-Also....the shore line should be straightened to horizontal.-On the down side, the horizon is substantially slanted to the left.  Darn! I thought it was straight... I think the slanted figure of the  mountain just tricked me. The funniest thing is that I QA this type of stuff as part of my job, and I''m sometimes blamed to be very fussy... Better to get my eyes checked I guess.  Thanks for the comments...', '2006-11-11 03:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
