(3024027, 419120, 37608, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/> Well I will start with what I saw technically on this photo. First I couldn''t really find a subject of the photo my eyes just kinda wandered around till I got board. Also the colors are really washed out. One thing I did like was the motion blur on the few leaves that were blowing. this was a good concept but you need to find a way to give it more of a subject like having the leaves in the foreground blowing or something like that. It also looks like you didn''t put a lot of effort into the photo. <br/> <br/> Sorry I don''t have much more to say I just could find a subject and the photo didn''t appeal to me at all. Keep trying though it will come.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-12 15:33:36.</i></td>', ':: Critique Club ::  Well I will start with what I saw technically on this photo. First I couldn''t really find a subject of the photo my eyes just kinda wandered around till I got board. Also the colors are really washed out. One thing I did like was the motion blur on the few leaves that were blowing. this was a good concept but you need to find a way to give it more of a subject like having the leaves in the foreground blowing or something like that. It also looks like you didn''t put a lot of effort into the photo.   Sorry I don''t have much more to say I just could find a subject and the photo didn''t appeal to me at all. Keep trying though it will come.', '2006-11-12 15:32:13.000000', '2006-11-12 15:33:36.000000', 0),
